<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:12.160" end="00:00:15.880" style="s2">Baby, [snorts] I want you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.199" end="00:00:33.920" style="s2">I&#39;m having this dream again. Two years</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.760" end="00:00:36.079" style="s2">ago, my husband got into a car crash and</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.920" end="00:00:38.480" style="s2">lost his ability. We haven&#39;t been</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.079" end="00:00:40.239" style="s2">intimate for two full years. I just</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.480" end="00:00:42.000" style="s2">started to accept our sexless marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.239" end="00:00:45.559" style="s2">Then an earth shaking secret landed</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.000" end="00:00:45.559" style="s2">right on my lap.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.640" end="00:00:53.520" style="s2">Martha. Ma&#39;am, Mr. Voss let me go cuz he</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.440" end="00:00:55.600" style="s2">said I&#39;m getting too old. I came to say</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.520" end="00:00:57.680" style="s2">goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.600" end="00:00:59.120" style="s2">Martha, you&#39;ve worked hard for us for</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.680" end="00:01:01.120" style="s2">five whole years. I&#39;m calling Jason</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.120" end="00:01:02.800" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.120" end="00:01:04.320" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, Mr. Vus calls all the shots</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.800" end="00:01:06.080" style="s2">around here. I don&#39;t want to put you in</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.320" end="00:01:07.840" style="s2">a tough spot. Besides, I already landed</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.080" end="00:01:09.680" style="s2">a new job that pays twice as much as</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.840" end="00:01:13.320" style="s2">this place.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.680" end="00:01:13.320" style="s2">Wait right here, Martha.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.015" end="00:01:17.040" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.040" end="00:01:19.520" style="s2">Martha, I know your daughter&#39;s a single</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.040" end="00:01:22.960" style="s2">mom struggling. This is 50 grand I keep</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.520" end="00:01:27.000" style="s2">stashed here for emergencies. Take it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.960" end="00:01:27.000" style="s2">Thank you so much, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.119" end="00:01:32.799" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, I don&#39;t know if I should say</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.479" end="00:01:34.799" style="s2">this, but go ahead. Speak your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.799" end="00:01:38.840" style="s2">When I cleaned out Mr. V&#39;s bedroom trash</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.799" end="00:01:38.840" style="s2">can, I found some odd items.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.240" end="00:01:50.200" style="s2">The trash can&#39;s already emptied. Where&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.479" end="00:01:50.200" style="s2">the stuff Martha mentioned?</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.281" end="00:01:57.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.840" end="00:02:08.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said he couldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.079" end="00:02:08.680" style="s2">Two whole years. It was all a lie.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.879" end="00:02:20.760" style="s2">The Ritz, a presidential suite booked</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.520" end="00:02:20.760" style="s2">last night.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.280" end="00:02:26.360" style="s2">Cardier, a diamond necklace for</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.360" end="00:02:26.360" style="s2">$128,000.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.080" end="00:02:31.599" style="s2">He lied and told me he was working</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.440" end="00:02:33.040" style="s2">overtime at the office last night. But</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.599" end="00:02:34.879" style="s2">this receipt proves he spent the whole</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.040" end="00:02:36.239" style="s2">night holed up in a luxury hotel suite</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.879" end="00:02:39.239" style="s2">and bought another woman a diamond</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.239" end="00:02:39.239" style="s2">necklace.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.040" end="00:02:44.879" style="s2">My husband&#39;s never been incapable at</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.879" end="00:02:48.840" style="s2">all. He&#39;s just been cheating on me with</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.879" end="00:02:48.840" style="s2">another woman this whole time.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.611" end="00:02:53.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.760" end="00:03:00.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A used rapper, a hotel suite, an</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.480" end="00:03:00.920" style="s2">insanely expensive diamond necklace.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.440" end="00:03:05.440" style="s2">That&#39;s what Martha was trying to hint.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.680" end="00:03:08.840" style="s2">My husband&#39;s been lying and cheating on</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.440" end="00:03:08.840" style="s2">me all along.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.840" end="00:03:14.920" style="s2">Who&#39;s the woman he&#39;s been cheating with?</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.680" end="00:03:14.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m home.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.280" end="00:03:22.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m back, too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.879" end="00:03:23.920" style="s2">It&#39;s her, Khloe Merson. Khloe Merson, my</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.000" end="00:03:25.519" style="s2">husband&#39;s late brother&#39;s widow. Two</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.920" end="00:03:27.200" style="s2">years ago, my husband&#39;s elder brother</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.519" end="00:03:29.200" style="s2">died in a car accident, and he has been</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.200" end="00:03:30.640" style="s2">taking care of her ever since. Last</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.200" end="00:03:32.480" style="s2">night, he even brought her back to live</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.640" end="00:03:34.159" style="s2">at home.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.480" end="00:03:37.159" style="s2">Chloe, how come you two arrived</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.159" end="00:03:37.159" style="s2">together?</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.200" end="00:03:41.599" style="s2">I ran into Jason on the road, so he gave</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.040" end="00:03:43.920" style="s2">me a ride home.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.599" end="00:03:47.360" style="s2">Do you not want me here?</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.920" end="00:03:49.360" style="s2">That&#39;s not what I meant at all.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.360" end="00:03:52.959" style="s2">No one&#39;s going to kick you out. This is</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.360" end="00:03:54.799" style="s2">my house and it is yours, too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.959" end="00:03:59.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.799" end="00:03:59.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s my favorite champagne out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.720" end="00:04:10.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, this wine&#39;s incredible. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.799" end="00:04:10.760" style="s2">always had such great taste.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.480" end="00:04:16.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as you love it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.880" end="00:04:23.079" style="s2">What the hell are you two doing?</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.080" end="00:04:28.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your problem all of a sudden?</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.199" end="00:04:33.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could you act that intimate with her</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.880" end="00:04:36.000" style="s2">right in front of me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.280" end="00:04:38.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, we&#39;ve always been close. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.000" end="00:04:41.840" style="s2">just a glass of wine.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.960" end="00:04:45.479" style="s2">You&#39;re being way too petty.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.840" end="00:04:45.479" style="s2">Petty, am I?</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.560" end="00:04:53.800" style="s2">Jason, your wife&#39;s way too bitter. You</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.600" end="00:04:53.800" style="s2">need to talk some sense into her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.320" end="00:05:02.080" style="s2">Fine. I&#39;m petty. I&#39;m the bad guy.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.240" end="00:05:05.080" style="s2">If you love drinking together so much,</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.080" end="00:05:05.080" style="s2">fine.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.120" end="00:05:14.960" style="s2">Elaine, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.199" end="00:05:29.000" style="s2">Are you all right, baby?</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.720" end="00:05:29.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was so scared a second ago.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.160" end="00:05:34.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re tired of living a good life,</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.520" end="00:05:36.080" style="s2">aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.160" end="00:05:39.759" style="s2">Don&#39;t forget, you&#39;re just a housewife</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.080" end="00:05:41.759" style="s2">who lives off my money.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.759" end="00:05:43.360" style="s2">Lay a hand on her again and you won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.759" end="00:05:44.320" style="s2">hold the title, Mrs. Voss for much</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.360" end="00:05:46.639" style="s2">longer.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.320" end="00:05:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m still so shaken up.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.639" end="00:05:49.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay here and think about what you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.000" end="00:05:52.600" style="s2">done.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.120" end="00:05:52.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go, Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.280" end="00:06:00.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two people who once loved each other</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.720" end="00:06:03.120" style="s2">more than anything when we were young.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.560" end="00:06:04.800" style="s2">We&#39;ve drifted so far apart. After 5</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.120" end="00:06:06.479" style="s2">years of marriage, I finally have zero</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.800" end="00:06:08.319" style="s2">doubts. My husband&#39;s been cheating all</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.479" end="00:06:10.880" style="s2">along with his late brother&#39;s widow, no</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.319" end="00:06:13.440" style="s2">less.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.880" end="00:06:16.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Elaine. It&#39;s about time you called</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.440" end="00:06:16.440" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.360" end="00:06:24.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo,</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.280" end="00:06:24.840" style="s2">I want a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.199" end="00:06:31.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, what happened to you?</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.560" end="00:06:41.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going back home to where I belong.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.039" end="00:06:48.960" style="s2">A broken marriage needs to be cut off</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.720" end="00:06:50.880" style="s2">without hesitation. A man who&#39;s tainted</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.960" end="00:06:53.600" style="s2">inside and out isn&#39;t worth clinging to</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.880" end="00:06:57.639" style="s2">at all. Jason Vus, I don&#39;t want the</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.600" end="00:06:57.639" style="s2">title Mrs. Vus anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.840" end="00:07:05.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tam never hosts Whis.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.520" end="00:07:07.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beverly Hills. That&#39;s the most expensive</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.440" end="00:07:10.520" style="s2">wealthy neighborhood in Aurora City.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.199" end="00:07:10.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s correct.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.599" end="00:07:30.919" style="s2">We&#39;re here, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.080" end="00:07:30.919" style="s2">The phase $10 cash or card.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.840" end="00:07:42.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Insufficient funds. Payment declined.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.120" end="00:07:42.120" style="s2">Declined.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.120" end="00:07:48.120" style="s2">How could my account be empty? There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.880" end="00:07:48.120" style="s2">no way.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.080" end="00:07:55.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; David, check the balance on the joint</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.840" end="00:07:56.240" style="s2">account Jason and I share from you right</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.360" end="00:07:59.039" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.240" end="00:08:00.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Voss, 3 days ago, Mr. Voss removed</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.039" end="00:08:02.639" style="s2">your name from the joint account and</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.800" end="00:08:04.800" style="s2">transferred every single dollar into his</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.639" end="00:08:07.325" style="s2">personal trust fund. Didn&#39;t he inform</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.800" end="00:08:07.680" style="s2">you about this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.325" end="00:08:09.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.680" end="00:08:09.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? How much money is left in the</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.120" end="00:08:12.080" style="s2">account now?</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.759" end="00:08:14.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only $4.60.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.080" end="00:08:15.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this is the surprise Jason Boss</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.000" end="00:08:18.240" style="s2">prepared for me. He didn&#39;t just sneak</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.840" end="00:08:20.080" style="s2">away all our marital assets. He cut me</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.240" end="00:08:24.360" style="s2">out of our shared account entirely,</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.080" end="00:08:24.360" style="s2">leaving me with a merely $4.60.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.665" end="00:08:29.840" style="s2">[music] Thank you for letting me know,</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.039" end="00:08:34.080" style="s2">David.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.840" end="00:08:36.880" style="s2">Khloe&#39;s actually calling me herself now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.080" end="00:08:39.519" style="s2">Elaine, are you doing all right? Cut the</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.880" end="00:08:42.080" style="s2">fake concern. Elaine, I might as well</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.519" end="00:08:44.399" style="s2">lay it all out for you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.080" end="00:08:47.680" style="s2">Jason used your joint money to buy me an</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.399" end="00:08:49.920" style="s2">oceanfront mansion for $8 million.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.680" end="00:08:53.600" style="s2">He even hired a full-time chauffeur and</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.920" end="00:08:55.680" style="s2">two live-in maids just for me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.600" end="00:08:57.519" style="s2">You&#39;ve got zero money to your name now,</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.680" end="00:09:02.120" style="s2">don&#39;t you,</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.519" end="00:09:02.120" style="s2">Elaine? I honestly feel bad for you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.560" end="00:09:18.560" style="s2">Jason, don&#39;t go back tonight. Stay here</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.519" end="00:09:20.959" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.560" end="00:09:24.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t we have enough fun last night?</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.959" end="00:09:24.600" style="s2">You&#39;re such a tease.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.600" end="00:09:30.600" style="s2">Sam,</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.279" end="00:09:37.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; won&#39;t a line get suspicious?</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.279" end="00:09:37.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, she&#39;ll never find out.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.320" end="00:09:42.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, you still haven&#39;t paid your fair.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.560" end="00:09:48.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one instead.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.320" end="00:09:52.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Centurion black card. Only</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.959" end="00:09:56.480" style="s2">billionaires and the ultra wealthy</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.480" end="00:09:56.480" style="s2">qualify for this exclusive card.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.560" end="00:10:03.880" style="s2">I&#39;m home.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.279" end="00:10:12.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.440" end="00:10:18.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Harrison.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.360" end="00:10:24.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Myth.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.200" end="00:10:24.519" style="s2">It&#39;s me,</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.560" end="00:10:30.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Home. Miss,</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.040" end="00:10:38.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; welcome home. Miss</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.000" end="00:11:09.440" style="s2">Let&#39;s give it up for the prodigy Elaine</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.720" end="00:11:12.240" style="s2">Hail. She shattered core industry</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.440" end="00:11:15.312" style="s2">barriers and successfully developed the</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.240" end="00:11:17.332" style="s2">third generation microchip.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.312" end="00:11:17.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.440" end="00:11:20.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; pain.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.827" end="00:11:25.847" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.120" end="00:11:31.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.722" end="00:11:31.742" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.680" end="00:11:36.680" style="s2">Elaine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.839" end="00:11:46.098" style="s2">Elaine,</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.079" end="00:11:47.519" style="s2">you&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.098" end="00:11:50.920" style="s2">[snorts] Our Elaine is finally back</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.519" end="00:11:50.920" style="s2">where she belongs.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.480" end="00:11:56.920" style="s2">Five whole years and I&#39;m finally back.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.959" end="00:12:06.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, what&#39;s my total net worth right</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.480" end="00:12:09.360" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.880" end="00:12:11.040" style="s2">Elaine, Peak Global, the company you</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.360" end="00:12:13.920" style="s2">built from scratch, is still the</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.040" end="00:12:16.320" style="s2">undisputed leader in tech.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.920" end="00:12:18.848" style="s2">Your assets span the globe, totaling</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.320" end="00:12:20.160" style="s2">roughly $50 billion.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.848" end="00:12:22.240" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.160" end="00:12:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;s Vosc holding up?</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.240" end="00:12:27.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over the past 5 years, Jason&#39;s Vosc has</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.800" end="00:12:29.440" style="s2">only thrived because of the exclusive</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.040" end="00:12:31.839" style="s2">partnerships Peak Global handed them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.440" end="00:12:34.720" style="s2">Thanks to you, he&#39;s now a $3 billion</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.839" end="00:12:37.760" style="s2">tech upstart.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.720" end="00:12:39.360" style="s2">Frankly, Jason Voss owes you everything.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.760" end="00:12:40.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.360" end="00:12:42.959" style="s2">None of it would have been possible</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.639" end="00:12:44.480" style="s2">without me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.959" end="00:12:46.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, I need you to handle something for</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.480" end="00:12:48.800" style="s2">me right away.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.639" end="00:12:52.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.800" end="00:12:55.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put out an official announcement.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.000" end="00:12:59.600" style="s2">I&#39;m making my full return to Peak Global</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.120" end="00:13:01.920" style="s2">and we&#39;re hosting a grand comeback gala.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.600" end="00:13:04.399" style="s2">Elaine, you&#39;re finally taking back the</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.920" end="00:13:05.519" style="s2">reigns of your empire. The whole city&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.399" end="00:13:06.800" style="s2">going to lose its mind over your</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.519" end="00:13:09.839" style="s2">comeback.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.800" end="00:13:12.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make sure Jason Voss, CEO of Vostech,</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.839" end="00:13:13.040" style="s2">gets a personal invitation.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.559" end="00:13:14.959" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.040" end="00:13:17.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Consider it done. I&#39;ll make sure he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.959" end="00:13:18.800" style="s2">seated front and center as our guest of</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.200" end="00:13:21.519" style="s2">honor.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.800" end="00:13:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got the wrong idea.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.519" end="00:13:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wrong idea.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.880" end="00:13:29.680" style="s2">This comeback isn&#39;t a celebration, but</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.279" end="00:13:32.959" style="s2">the start of my reckoning. I&#39;m taking</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.680" end="00:13:35.600" style="s2">back everything I gave Jason.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.959" end="00:13:41.480" style="s2">And I&#39;m going to reduce him right back</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.600" end="00:13:41.480" style="s2">to the nobody he was 5 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.639" end="00:13:47.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, I didn&#39;t mishar you on the phone</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.040" end="00:13:49.760" style="s2">earlier, did I?</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.440" end="00:13:51.600" style="s2">You want a divorce?</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.760" end="00:13:54.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young mistress, did that good for</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.600" end="00:13:56.399" style="s2">nothing Jason hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.079" end="00:13:58.160" style="s2">He&#39;d better not dare. Need I remind you</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.399" end="00:14:02.920" style="s2">that he got down on his knees and begged</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.160" end="00:14:02.920" style="s2">you to marry him, crying like a baby.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.120" end="00:14:11.720" style="s2">Elaine, I love you. Please marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.320" end="00:14:17.040" style="s2">I don&#39;t have much money right now, but</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.880" end="00:14:20.040" style="s2">one day I&#39;ll give you the whole world. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.040" end="00:14:20.040" style="s2">swear</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.680" end="00:14:24.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.160" end="00:14:30.720" style="s2">I was so blinded by love back then. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.959" end="00:14:34.399" style="s2">walked away from everything that made me</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.720" end="00:14:36.959" style="s2">a lane hail just to be his Mrs. Voss. He</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.399" end="00:14:40.000" style="s2">promised me the whole world. But today I</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.959" end="00:14:41.600" style="s2">found out he gave that world to another</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.000" end="00:14:44.079" style="s2">woman.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.600" end="00:14:46.880" style="s2">He built a billion dollar forfe and left</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.079" end="00:14:50.160" style="s2">me with $4.60.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.880" end="00:14:52.320" style="s2">That&#39;s how he repaid me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.160" end="00:14:55.440" style="s2">Leo, I want a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.320" end="00:14:58.320" style="s2">Mrs. Voss is dead. The woman standing</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.440" end="00:15:00.560" style="s2">here now is Elaine Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.320" end="00:15:05.120" style="s2">I&#39;m going to drag him right back down to</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.560" end="00:15:06.959" style="s2">the penniles loser he was 5 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.120" end="00:15:08.399" style="s2">That&#39;s the price he pays for cheating on</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.959" end="00:15:10.639" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.399" end="00:15:14.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever you say, I&#39;ll get the ball</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.639" end="00:15:14.120" style="s2">rolling right now.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.440" end="00:15:25.000" style="s2">Margaret&#39;s calling.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.600" end="00:15:31.000" style="s2">Elaine, where the hell have you been?</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.199" end="00:15:35.680" style="s2">Jason&#39;s mother is confined to a</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.800" end="00:15:38.160" style="s2">wheelchair. For 5 years of marriage,</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.680" end="00:15:40.800" style="s2">every time Jason was away on business, I</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.160" end="00:15:43.440" style="s2">was the one taking care of her. And not</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.800" end="00:15:45.920" style="s2">once did she ever say thank you. All I</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.440" end="00:15:47.839" style="s2">ever got was criticism</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.920" end="00:15:50.639" style="s2">and complaints.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.839" end="00:15:53.600" style="s2">Elaine, I asked you where you&#39;ve been.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.639" end="00:15:56.639" style="s2">Are you deaf or just plain stupid? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.600" end="00:15:59.600" style="s2">listening. I&#39;ve been waiting two whole</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.639" end="00:16:03.519" style="s2">hours. Get over here right now and help</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.600" end="00:16:05.600" style="s2">me bathe. I need it done immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.519" end="00:16:08.839" style="s2">What was that? Bad signal. I&#39;m hanging</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.600" end="00:16:08.839" style="s2">up now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.000" end="00:16:17.040" style="s2">That old bat must be fuming right about</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.000" end="00:16:19.120" style="s2">now. I&#39;ll let her stew for the night.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.040" end="00:16:20.720" style="s2">Tomorrow, I&#39;ll pay her a visit and</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.120" end="00:16:23.720" style="s2">settle the score with both of them at</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.720" end="00:16:23.720" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.639" end="00:16:34.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That Elaine Hail has got some nerve</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.639" end="00:16:36.560" style="s2">hanging up on me. Jason, you need to</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.240" end="00:16:39.360" style="s2">divorce her in soon.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.560" end="00:16:41.600" style="s2">Mom, the company&#39;s in a critical growth</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.360" end="00:16:44.399" style="s2">phase right now. I can&#39;t divorce her</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.600" end="00:16:46.399" style="s2">yet. When she gets here later, I&#39;ll give</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.399" end="00:16:48.800" style="s2">her a piece of my mind. Okay,</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.399" end="00:16:51.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; calm down, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.800" end="00:16:53.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least Chloe&#39;s a good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.360" end="00:16:55.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Chloe&#39;s got some great news for</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.279" end="00:16:56.880" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.261" end="00:16:59.600" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.880" end="00:17:00.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m pregnant. I&#39;m having Jason&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.600" end="00:17:01.759" style="s2">baby.</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.160" end="00:17:04.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, you&#39;re pregnant. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.759" end="00:17:06.319" style="s2">wonderful. I&#39;m going to be a grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.000" end="00:17:08.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe&#39;s pregnant. So, this whole</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.319" end="00:17:12.760" style="s2">family&#39;s been conspiring behind my back,</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.959" end="00:17:12.760" style="s2">treating me like a fool.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.439" end="00:17:17.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s everyone chatting about?</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.880" end="00:17:19.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect timing, Elaine. Apologize to</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.280" end="00:17:22.160" style="s2">Khloe and mom right now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.600" end="00:17:24.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. I&#39;m always in the wrong and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.160" end="00:17:25.280" style="s2">all perfect. Happy?</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.160" end="00:17:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.280" end="00:17:28.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clearly, you haven&#39;t learned your</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.480" end="00:17:31.600" style="s2">lesson. Tomorrow, it&#39;s Peak Global&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.640" end="00:17:35.240" style="s2">comeback gala. Stay home. I&#39;m taking</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.600" end="00:17:35.240" style="s2">Chloe with me instead.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.679" end="00:17:41.039" style="s2">Peak Global&#39;s comeback gala. Mom, Peak</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.440" end="00:17:43.360" style="s2">Global&#39;s the biggest tech giant out</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.039" end="00:17:45.679" style="s2">there. Everyone says their founder, Miss</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.360" end="00:17:48.317" style="s2">Hail, is a total prodigy, and she</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.679" end="00:17:48.960" style="s2">stepped back 5 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.317" end="00:17:50.720" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.960" end="00:17:53.039" style="s2">Now she&#39;s making her comeback, and the</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.720" end="00:17:55.919" style="s2">whole city&#39;s buzzing. Tomorrow&#39;s gala is</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.039" end="00:17:58.320" style="s2">going to be packed with all the elite.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.919" end="00:18:00.240" style="s2">Elen, Jason&#39;s taking me as his plus</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.320" end="00:18:02.960" style="s2">scum. You don&#39;t have a problem with</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.240" end="00:18:04.640" style="s2">that, do you? These past few years, Vos</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.960" end="00:18:07.280" style="s2">Group has only thrived because of our</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.640" end="00:18:09.919" style="s2">partnership with Peak Global.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.280" end="00:18:11.440" style="s2">Miss Hail is my biggest benefactor.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.919" end="00:18:14.000" style="s2">You&#39;re just a plain housewife who&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.440" end="00:18:16.480" style="s2">out of place there. I&#39;m afraid you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.000" end="00:18:19.120" style="s2">embarrass me in front of Miss Hail, so</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.480" end="00:18:22.720" style="s2">Khloe&#39;s coming instead.</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.120" end="00:18:25.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine by me. Go ahead, both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.720" end="00:18:26.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why&#39;d she agree so easily? That&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.440" end="00:18:28.880" style="s2">like her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.799" end="00:18:33.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, the custom gown you ordered for</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.880" end="00:18:33.720" style="s2">me just arrived. Let&#39;s go try it on.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.160" end="00:18:41.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember this, Elaine. You only live</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.400" end="00:18:43.280" style="s2">this well only because of my son. Your</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.280" end="00:18:45.440" style="s2">job is to wait on him hand and foot.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.280" end="00:18:49.160" style="s2">Don&#39;t you ever forget it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.440" end="00:18:49.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See you tomorrow then.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.559" end="00:18:53.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. Miss Hail&#39;s comeback gala is so</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.559" end="00:18:55.280" style="s2">lavish.</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.520" end="00:18:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every big name in Aurora City turned out</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.280" end="00:18:59.520" style="s2">for this.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.880" end="00:19:02.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, good afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.520" end="00:19:06.080" style="s2">Good afternoon. Has Miss Hail arrived</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.160" end="00:19:07.760" style="s2">yet? Any minute now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.080" end="00:19:09.679" style="s2">We&#39;re all dying to see the legendary</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.760" end="00:19:13.720" style="s2">Miss Hail in person.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.679" end="00:19:13.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail has arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.840" end="00:19:30.000" style="s2">Young mistress, the comeback gala is</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.400" end="00:19:31.760" style="s2">already underway.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.000" end="00:19:33.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has Jason arrived?</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.760" end="00:19:34.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, Chloe, and Margaret are all</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.840" end="00:19:36.880" style="s2">there. They&#39;re waiting for your</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.960" end="00:19:39.880" style="s2">entrance.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.880" end="00:19:39.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.760" end="00:19:51.360" style="s2">Young mistress, this is the gown for the</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.440" end="00:19:52.960" style="s2">gala. It&#39;s a custom couture crystal</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.360" end="00:19:53.760" style="s2">dress, one of a kind in the entire</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.960" end="00:19:55.520" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.760" end="00:20:00.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I walked away from my peak to marry</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.520" end="00:20:00.039" style="s2">Jason. Gave up everything for him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.480" end="00:20:04.320" style="s2">And what did he call me? A frmpy</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.720" end="00:20:07.600" style="s2">housewife who&#39;d never fit in with high</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.320" end="00:20:10.640" style="s2">society. Today, everyone&#39;s going to see</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.600" end="00:20:13.919" style="s2">Mrs. Voss was just a label.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.640" end="00:20:13.919" style="s2">I&#39;m Elaine Hall.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.720" end="00:20:27.760" style="s2">You look breathtaking, miss. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.480" end="00:20:29.120" style="s2">wait to see the look on that dead beat</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.760" end="00:20:32.360" style="s2">Jason&#39;s face when he sees you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.120" end="00:20:32.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.520" end="00:20:44.640" style="s2">Miss Hail&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.039" end="00:20:47.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, I get to meet Miss Hail in</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.640" end="00:20:47.640" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.200" end="00:21:18.120" style="s2">Why is Elaine here? Since when did</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.240" end="00:21:18.120" style="s2">Elaine look this stunning?</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.320" end="00:21:27.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, what are you doing here? And why</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.600" end="00:21:30.559" style="s2">are you dressed like that?</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.200" end="00:21:32.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Am I not allowed to dress up?</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.559" end="00:21:33.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never thought Elaine could look this</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.159" end="00:21:35.600" style="s2">radiant.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.840" end="00:21:37.679" style="s2">Good evening, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.600" end="00:21:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening. You&#39;ve got it wrong. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.679" end="00:21:42.799" style="s2">not Mrs. Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.000" end="00:21:45.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.799" end="00:21:47.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Voss is so beautiful and elegant.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.360" end="00:21:49.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why have we never seen Mr. Voss bring</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.039" end="00:21:50.640" style="s2">Mrs. Voss to events before? With a wife</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.360" end="00:21:53.880" style="s2">this stunning, he should show her off</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.640" end="00:21:53.880" style="s2">more often.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.320" end="00:21:59.360" style="s2">She&#39;s just here to seduce Jason. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.159" end="00:22:02.000" style="s2">make sure she regrets crashing this.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.360" end="00:22:03.679" style="s2">Elaine, weren&#39;t you supposed to be home?</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.000" end="00:22:06.960" style="s2">Who said you could come here? I go</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.679" end="00:22:08.559" style="s2">wherever I want, whenever I want. Fine,</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.960" end="00:22:10.480" style="s2">you can stay. But why dress like this?</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.559" end="00:22:11.760" style="s2">Mrs. Hail is the guest of honor tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.480" end="00:22:13.760" style="s2">You&#39;re trying to steal her spock plate.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.760" end="00:22:15.280" style="s2">She&#39;s going to be furious. Typical.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.760" end="00:22:17.520" style="s2">She&#39;s so classless she&#39;d even try to</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.280" end="00:22:19.520" style="s2">outshunt Miss Hail. What are we going to</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.520" end="00:22:21.280" style="s2">do about this?</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.520" end="00:22:23.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.280" end="00:22:25.360" style="s2">She just needs to take that gown off</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.679" end="00:22:28.360" style="s2">right here, right now, in front of</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.360" end="00:22:28.360" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.840" end="00:22:34.960" style="s2">You actually expect me to strip in front</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.679" end="00:22:36.720" style="s2">of all these people?</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.960" end="00:22:38.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, you&#39;re just a housewife.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.720" end="00:22:39.679" style="s2">Dressing like this, you&#39;re just begging</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.080" end="00:22:40.960" style="s2">for attention, aren&#39;t you? Take that</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.679" end="00:22:43.039" style="s2">gown off right now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.960" end="00:22:44.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. A nobody housewife doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.039" end="00:22:47.600" style="s2">deserve a dress this gorgeous. Take it</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.880" end="00:22:49.440" style="s2">off now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.600" end="00:22:52.840" style="s2">Why would I do anything you say? Who do</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.440" end="00:22:52.840" style="s2">you think you are?</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.159" end="00:22:58.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, look how she&#39;s talking to me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.840" end="00:22:59.600" style="s2">Keep your lane.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.000" end="00:23:02.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop trying to steal Miss Hail&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.600" end="00:23:03.919" style="s2">spotlight. Take the gown off. It was</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.240" end="00:23:05.600" style="s2">never meant for someone like you anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.919" end="00:23:07.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, so what am I meant for? Worn out</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.600" end="00:23:09.280" style="s2">clothes in an apron waiting on your</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.200" end="00:23:10.960" style="s2">family 24/7 like your free maid?</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.280" end="00:23:11.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that exactly what you signed up</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.960" end="00:23:13.840" style="s2">for?</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.679" end="00:23:17.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Let me show you what I&#39;m actually</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.840" end="00:23:17.159" style="s2">going to do.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.960" end="00:23:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not going anywhere. You&#39;re taking</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.120" end="00:23:26.720" style="s2">that dress off and you&#39;re doing it</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.720" end="00:23:28.799" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.720" end="00:23:30.240" style="s2">If you won&#39;t do it yourself, we&#39;ll do it</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.799" end="00:23:32.080" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.240" end="00:23:34.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you two think you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.080" end="00:23:37.480" style="s2">Jason, get over here and tear this dress</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.240" end="00:23:37.480" style="s2">off her.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.679" end="00:23:40.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, don&#39;t you dare lay a finger on</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.360" end="00:23:41.440" style="s2">this gown. If you do, you&#39;ll pay for it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.880" end="00:23:43.600" style="s2">Dearly</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.440" end="00:23:47.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; threatening me now, are you? Let&#39;s see</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.600" end="00:23:47.559" style="s2">what price I have to pay then.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.601" end="00:24:08.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.159" end="00:24:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There, Elaine. We took your stupid fancy</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.559" end="00:24:12.640" style="s2">dress off.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.760" end="00:24:14.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See, no consequences at all. Housewives</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.640" end="00:24:17.600" style="s2">don&#39;t belong in Coutur. Now go home</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.880" end="00:24:22.480" style="s2">where you belong.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.600" end="00:24:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kevin, bring your team over here now.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.480" end="00:24:30.360" style="s2">Elaine, who did you just call?</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.480" end="00:24:30.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll find out soon enough.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.731" end="00:24:38.000" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.240" end="00:24:41.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.000" end="00:24:42.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kevin, the gown&#39;s been ruined.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.520" end="00:24:44.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who did this?</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.400" end="00:24:45.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We did. It&#39;s just a cheap dress. No need</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.159" end="00:24:47.360" style="s2">to make such a big fuss over nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.600" end="00:24:48.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have any idea how much this gown</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.360" end="00:24:50.960" style="s2">is worth?</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.799" end="00:24:52.559" style="s2">How expensive could it possibly be?</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.960" end="00:24:54.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a one-of-a-kind couture crystal</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.559" end="00:24:56.960" style="s2">gown. It&#39;s handsewn with 751 natural</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.799" end="00:24:58.480" style="s2">diamonds weighing over,000 carats total.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.960" end="00:25:01.360" style="s2">There is not another one like it on the</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.480" end="00:25:02.799" style="s2">planet. Its value is $372 million. Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.360" end="00:25:04.400" style="s2">Hail rented this gown for tonight&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.799" end="00:25:06.480" style="s2">event. You tore it so you will</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.400" end="00:25:08.080" style="s2">compensate for the full retail value?</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.480" end="00:25:12.080" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.080" end="00:25:14.559" style="s2">$372 million?</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.080" end="00:25:17.880" style="s2">$372 million. How would you like to</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.559" end="00:25:17.880" style="s2">settle this?</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.240" end="00:25:26.159" style="s2">372 million. Your entire net worth is</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.919" end="00:25:29.520" style="s2">only 3 billion, Jason. This is going to</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.159" end="00:25:31.039" style="s2">cost you an arm and a leg.</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.520" end="00:25:32.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine,</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.039" end="00:25:34.559" style="s2">who gave you permission to rent a gown</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.720" end="00:25:36.080" style="s2">this absurdly expensive?</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.559" end="00:25:37.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s it to you if I spend a little</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.080" end="00:25:39.200" style="s2">money? You&#39;ve got enough to keep a</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.679" end="00:25:40.000" style="s2">mistress on the side, but not enough for</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.200" end="00:25:43.120" style="s2">your own wife.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.000" end="00:25:46.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mistress? Everyone, I&#39;ve got something</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.120" end="00:25:49.840" style="s2">to say. My husband Jason cheated on me</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.400" end="00:25:51.520" style="s2">with his late brother&#39;s widow.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.840" end="00:25:53.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She found out everything.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.520" end="00:25:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vos is cheating with his late</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.679" end="00:25:57.360" style="s2">brother&#39;s widow. No wonder he brought</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.440" end="00:25:58.559" style="s2">Khloe instead of his own wife tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.360" end="00:26:00.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew there was something going on</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.559" end="00:26:02.640" style="s2">between those two.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.720" end="00:26:03.679" style="s2">Elaine, not here. We&#39;ll talk about this</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.640" end="00:26:06.559" style="s2">at home.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.679" end="00:26:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, we&#39;ll talk about it right here where</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.559" end="00:26:09.760" style="s2">everyone can hear the truth. Elaine,</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.400" end="00:26:10.720" style="s2">that&#39;s a lie. Jason and I are just</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.760" end="00:26:12.559" style="s2">friends, nothing more.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.720" end="00:26:14.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe is my late brother&#39;s widow. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.559" end="00:26:15.440" style="s2">only been looking out for her. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.000" end="00:26:16.799" style="s2">believe you&#39;re so petty to fabricate</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.440" end="00:26:18.720" style="s2">lies and slander us.</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.799" end="00:26:20.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just jealous of Chloe, Elaine.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.720" end="00:26:22.240" style="s2">Nothing more. After everything that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.960" end="00:26:25.679" style="s2">come to light, you&#39;re still trying to</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.240" end="00:26:28.000" style="s2">shift the blame on to me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.679" end="00:26:31.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a good look, everyone. My husband</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.000" end="00:26:31.480" style="s2">got her pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.679" end="00:26:35.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is an ultrasound report, and the</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.520" end="00:26:37.279" style="s2">patient&#39;s name is Chloe Murker. It was</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.520" end="00:26:38.559" style="s2">tucked in Margaret&#39;s pocket, which means</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.279" end="00:26:39.440" style="s2">all three of you have been plotting this</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.559" end="00:26:41.520" style="s2">together this whole time.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.440" end="00:26:44.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t look at that. Don&#39;t any of you</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.520" end="00:26:44.760" style="s2">believe her.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.279" end="00:26:50.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me that.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.960" end="00:26:52.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. Chloe is pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.799" end="00:26:54.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, you really have been cheating</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.960" end="00:26:56.799" style="s2">with your late brother&#39;s widow.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.559" end="00:26:57.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, just let me explain. It&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.799" end="00:26:59.520" style="s2">what you think.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.760" end="00:27:01.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The proof is right there. What&#39;s left to</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.520" end="00:27:03.200" style="s2">explain?</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.600" end="00:27:05.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, this is how you looked out for your</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.200" end="00:27:08.520" style="s2">late brother&#39;s widow all these years in</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.520" end="00:27:08.520" style="s2">bed.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.159" end="00:27:19.159" style="s2">Jason.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.760" end="00:27:27.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never would have pegged Mr. Voss as</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.360" end="00:27:29.120" style="s2">this kind of guy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.760" end="00:27:30.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew something was off when they</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.120" end="00:27:33.200" style="s2">ganged up to tear her dress off. That</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.880" end="00:27:36.200" style="s2">was just cruel.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.200" end="00:27:36.200" style="s2">Shameless.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.919" end="00:27:55.120" style="s2">STOP IT. DON&#39;T HURT MY SON.</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.120" end="00:27:57.200" style="s2">And don&#39;t think you&#39;re off the hook. You</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.120" end="00:27:59.439" style="s2">encourage your son to cheat. Those two</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.200" end="00:28:01.459" style="s2">are shameless, but you&#39;re even worse.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.439" end="00:28:01.459" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.880" end="00:28:08.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scream all you want. Compared to 5 years</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.919" end="00:28:09.679" style="s2">of lies and betrayal,</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.480" end="00:28:12.679" style="s2">this is just the start of your</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.679" end="00:28:12.679" style="s2">punishment.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.600" end="00:28:22.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You planned all of this, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.679" end="00:28:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not completely brainless, then. I</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.559" end="00:28:27.600" style="s2">knew you were cheating. I knew you&#39;d go</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.720" end="00:28:29.360" style="s2">after my dress.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.600" end="00:28:31.520" style="s2">And I knew that ultrasound was in your</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.360" end="00:28:33.600" style="s2">mother&#39;s pocket. I just played along</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.520" end="00:28:38.200" style="s2">with your little game and turned it into</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.600" end="00:28:38.200" style="s2">the most expensive joke of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.720" end="00:28:42.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, don&#39;t you dare lay a single</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.679" end="00:28:45.360" style="s2">finger on me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.880" end="00:28:46.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When did Elaine get this intimidating?</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.360" end="00:28:47.600" style="s2">She&#39;s nothing like the quiet wife I</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.960" end="00:28:51.480" style="s2">married.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.600" end="00:28:51.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Hail has arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.240" end="00:28:59.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Hail is here.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.039" end="00:29:00.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening, Mr. Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.279" end="00:29:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, Mr. Mr. Hail&#39;s here. Miss Hale</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.640" end="00:29:03.279" style="s2">must be with him.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.440" end="00:29:05.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, you know how important Miss Hail</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.279" end="00:29:08.000" style="s2">is to my entire career.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.760" end="00:29:09.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I know exactly how important she is.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.000" end="00:29:13.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you better behave yourself and keep</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.679" end="00:29:13.159" style="s2">your mouth shut.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.440" end="00:29:23.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Hail, good evening. I&#39;m Jason Voss,</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.320" end="00:29:25.520" style="s2">CEO of</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.200" end="00:29:27.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good Evening, Mr. Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.520" end="00:29:30.000" style="s2">Mr. Hail, has Miss Hail arrived for the</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.840" end="00:29:32.399" style="s2">gala tonight? Our miss has been here</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.000" end="00:29:36.120" style="s2">this whole time. Mr. Voss, have you</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.399" end="00:29:36.120" style="s2">really not noticed her?</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.880" end="00:29:40.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This deadbeat really needs to get his</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.880" end="00:29:44.159" style="s2">eyes checked.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.559" end="00:29:46.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I don&#39;t see her. Elaine, had enough</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.159" end="00:29:49.960" style="s2">fun yet? Mr. Voss has been asking for</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.559" end="00:29:49.960" style="s2">you all night.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.480" end="00:29:59.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t see Mrs. Hail. Do you?</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.159" end="00:30:01.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me neither. All I see is that stuck up a</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.840" end="00:30:04.880" style="s2">lane.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.039" end="00:30:06.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My chest. It hurts so bad.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.880" end="00:30:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.159" end="00:30:10.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s having an episode.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.440" end="00:30:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you bring your medication with you?</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.480" end="00:30:18.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry. We left in such a hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.200" end="00:30:18.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.399" end="00:30:21.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, since your mother&#39;s unwell, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.919" end="00:30:23.760" style="s2">call it a night for now. Do get well</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.919" end="00:30:25.760" style="s2">soon, ma&#39;am. Because tonight was just</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.760" end="00:30:28.760" style="s2">the appetizer. The main event&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.760" end="00:30:28.760" style="s2">coming.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.159" end="00:30:45.120" style="s2">Wait, why is Mr. Hail leaving?</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.840" end="00:30:46.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, we don&#39;t have her medicine here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.120" end="00:30:50.240" style="s2">We need to get mom home right now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.799" end="00:30:54.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.240" end="00:30:56.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, $372 million in damages. How</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.640" end="00:30:58.000" style="s2">will you be settling this? Elaine rented</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.480" end="00:30:58.559" style="s2">the dress. This has nothing to do with</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.000" end="00:31:00.240" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.559" end="00:31:02.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone in this room watched you tear</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.240" end="00:31:05.919" style="s2">it apart. You are fully liable. Pay up</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.960" end="00:31:10.760" style="s2">or I call 911 right now. Don&#39;t call the</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.919" end="00:31:10.760" style="s2">police. Charge it. Very well, Mr. Voss.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.600" end="00:31:22.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 372 million. My net worth just dropped</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.919" end="00:31:25.559" style="s2">by a tenth. Elaine Hail, you&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.159" end="00:31:25.559" style="s2">regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.559" end="00:31:33.919" style="s2">Sarah. Sarah.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.640" end="00:31:35.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, what&#39;s wrong with ma&#39;am?</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.919" end="00:31:36.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s having a heart episode. Get her</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.360" end="00:31:38.000" style="s2">medication now.</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.399" end="00:31:39.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, Mrs. Hail always kept all the</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.000" end="00:31:39.919" style="s2">medication. I have no idea where she</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.440" end="00:31:42.240" style="s2">stored it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.919" end="00:31:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEN LOOK FOR IT. HURRY UP.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.240" end="00:31:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CHECK THE DOORS.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.080" end="00:31:50.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found it. Found it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.600" end="00:32:05.039" style="s2">Mom, how do you feel now? Any better?</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.159" end="00:32:06.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My head, it&#39;s killing me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.039" end="00:32:07.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do for the headache?</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.000" end="00:32:08.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, Mrs. Voss always took care of this.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.679" end="00:32:10.159" style="s2">She even learned a special head massage</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.960" end="00:32:11.519" style="s2">routine that always made mom feel</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.159" end="00:32:13.440" style="s2">better. You should call her and ask her</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.519" end="00:32:16.000" style="s2">to come back.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.440" end="00:32:18.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, why won&#39;t Elaine come back? You</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.000" end="00:32:20.720" style="s2">two aren&#39;t divorced yet. Waiting on this</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.399" end="00:32:23.600" style="s2">family is her job. Call her back right</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.720" end="00:32:27.320" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.600" end="00:32:27.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, I&#39;ll call her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.240" end="00:32:39.880" style="s2">Right this way, miss.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.559" end="00:32:46.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s that dead beat. Jason,</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.519" end="00:32:51.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what do you want? Elaine, get back here</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.840" end="00:32:52.799" style="s2">right now. Mom took her meds, but her</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.360" end="00:32:53.919" style="s2">head still hurts. Get over here and take</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.799" end="00:32:56.240" style="s2">care of her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.919" end="00:32:57.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, listen carefully. From now on,</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.240" end="00:33:00.880" style="s2">someone else can wait on you and your</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.679" end="00:33:02.480" style="s2">mother. I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.880" end="00:33:03.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That deadbeat really thinks you&#39;d go</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.480" end="00:33:05.600" style="s2">running back to wait on them, doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.760" end="00:33:06.640" style="s2">he? Shame Jason didn&#39;t find out who you</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.600" end="00:33:08.720" style="s2">really are tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.640" end="00:33:11.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t rush it. I&#39;ll settle every last</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.720" end="00:33:12.720" style="s2">score with him, one by one. Leo, find me</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.519" end="00:33:14.559" style="s2">a lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.720" end="00:33:16.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A lawyer?</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.559" end="00:33:18.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know exactly how important Miss Hail</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.159" end="00:33:19.279" style="s2">is to Jason. So before he figures out</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.159" end="00:33:21.679" style="s2">the truth, I&#39;m going to make sure he</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.279" end="00:33:24.559" style="s2">loses Miss Hail forever. Get me the best</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.679" end="00:33:27.039" style="s2">lawyer you can find. I want a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.559" end="00:33:28.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my girl playing that loser like a</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.039" end="00:33:29.760" style="s2">fiddle.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.480" end="00:33:31.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That dead beat is going to regret</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.760" end="00:33:32.960" style="s2">everything he&#39;s done. Miss, come on,</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.519" end="00:33:35.440" style="s2">Elaine. Let me introduce you to the best</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.960" end="00:33:38.519" style="s2">lawyer in Ora City, Attorney Shaw.</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.440" end="00:33:38.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right,</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.919" end="00:33:49.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; that Elaine had some nerve. She actually</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.159" end="00:33:49.799" style="s2">hung up on me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.000" end="00:33:53.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, track down Elaine&#39;s location</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.640" end="00:33:55.840" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.440" end="00:33:58.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, is Elaine coming back? My head</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.840" end="00:34:01.120" style="s2">feels like it&#39;s going to split open.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.559" end="00:34:05.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a head massage. You do it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.120" end="00:34:05.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me? Okay, sure.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.240" end="00:34:11.520" style="s2">Mom, how&#39;s that feel? Any better?</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.359" end="00:34:14.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It still hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.520" end="00:34:17.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll press harder then. Ow, that hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.879" end="00:34:18.800" style="s2">Your nails are snagging my hair.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.520" end="00:34:20.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing,</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.800" end="00:34:22.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason? You told me to give her a</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.159" end="00:34:23.359" style="s2">massage. With those long fake nails, you</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.240" end="00:34:25.599" style="s2">don&#39;t know the first thing about giving</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.359" end="00:34:27.200" style="s2">massages. All you ever do is get your</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.599" end="00:34:29.200" style="s2">nails done, get your hair done, and shop</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.200" end="00:34:32.159" style="s2">for afternoon tea. You&#39;re nothing like</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.200" end="00:34:34.399" style="s2">the real Mrs. Voss. She ran this house</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.159" end="00:34:38.000" style="s2">perfectly without a single complaint.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.399" end="00:34:39.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop talking about her. Just give mom</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.000" end="00:34:41.040" style="s2">some painkillers.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.520" end="00:34:45.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But those painkillers have bad side</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.040" end="00:34:45.240" style="s2">effects. Just get them now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.040" end="00:34:54.320" style="s2">Mr. Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.440" end="00:34:58.119" style="s2">did you find where Elaine is? Mr. Voss,</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.320" end="00:34:58.119" style="s2">she&#39;s at a bar downtown.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.200" end="00:35:02.520" style="s2">A bar?</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.680" end="00:35:13.680" style="s2">Leo, why&#39;d you bring me to a bar? I came</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.440" end="00:35:15.280" style="s2">here to meet the lawyer. Sean&#39;s got a</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.680" end="00:35:18.280" style="s2">work event here. He&#39;ll be over in a</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.280" end="00:35:18.280" style="s2">minute.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.680" end="00:35:28.800" style="s2">Mr. Hail, good evening,</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.560" end="00:35:33.079" style="s2">Attorney Shaw. Glad you could make it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.800" end="00:35:33.079" style="s2">This is my sister, Elaine Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.280" end="00:35:38.240" style="s2">Miss Hail. I&#39;ve heard a great deal about</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.599" end="00:35:40.000" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.240" end="00:35:43.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening, Mr. Shaw.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.000" end="00:35:45.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s all sit down and talk.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.760" end="00:35:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail, I&#39;ve already been briefed on</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.359" end="00:35:51.040" style="s2">your situation. You want a divorce? How</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.000" end="00:35:53.760" style="s2">do you plan to split the marital assets?</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.040" end="00:35:55.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want a single scent. Jason&#39;s net</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.760" end="00:35:56.960" style="s2">worth is $3 billion, and I&#39;m not taking</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.599" end="00:35:59.960" style="s2">any of it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.960" end="00:35:59.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.200" end="00:36:05.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, we get the divorce finalized.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.920" end="00:36:10.200" style="s2">Then I&#39;m going after every last dollar</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.599" end="00:36:10.200" style="s2">of that 3 billion he built on my back.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.680" end="00:36:17.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood. I&#39;ll draft the divorce</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.920" end="00:36:17.320" style="s2">papers immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.880" end="00:36:22.520" style="s2">I&#39;ll take this outside.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.839" end="00:36:30.680" style="s2">Mr. Voss, she&#39;s in this booth right</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.680" end="00:36:30.680" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.680" end="00:36:47.000" style="s2">Mr. Boss, that&#39;s her. Who&#39;s the man with</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.000" end="00:36:47.000" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.560" end="00:36:53.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, what the hell is this?</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.119" end="00:36:55.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason,</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.839" end="00:36:59.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what are you doing in a place like this?</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.359" end="00:36:59.000" style="s2">Who is this guy?</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.760" end="00:37:03.440" style="s2">Why on earth would I owe you an</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.200" end="00:37:04.640" style="s2">explanation?</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.440" end="00:37:06.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, [snorts] you&#39;re cheating on me,</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.640" end="00:37:09.359" style="s2">aren&#39;t you? Sneaking around with another</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.400" end="00:37:10.800" style="s2">man behind my back.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.359" end="00:37:13.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Boss, you&#39;d better watch what you</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.800" end="00:37:15.200" style="s2">say. Accusations like that are</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.119" end="00:37:18.520" style="s2">deflamation. I could sue you for it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.200" end="00:37:18.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw,</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.800" end="00:37:21.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; would you mind stepping outside for a</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.400" end="00:37:25.000" style="s2">minute?</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.760" end="00:37:25.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.240" end="00:37:38.400" style="s2">So, what if I was? You cheated on me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.119" end="00:37:39.920" style="s2">Did you really think I&#39;d sit around</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.400" end="00:37:44.200" style="s2">pining for you, faithful to a man who</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.920" end="00:37:44.200" style="s2">doesn&#39;t deserve it in your dream?</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.119" end="00:37:49.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just lonely, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.440" end="00:37:54.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it. 2 years without sex, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.520" end="00:37:56.320" style="s2">you&#39;re probably dying for it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.240" end="00:37:58.880" style="s2">Get off me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.320" end="00:38:01.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, then let me take care of that for</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.880" end="00:38:01.880" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.720" end="00:38:21.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you dare touch me with your filthy</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.560" end="00:38:21.560" style="s2">hands.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.240" end="00:38:25.280" style="s2">playing hard to get now. I told you I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.000" end="00:38:28.280" style="s2">going to touch you and you can&#39;t stop</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.280" end="00:38:28.280" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.680" end="00:38:33.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.400" end="00:38:41.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two years apart and you&#39;ve gotten so</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.760" end="00:38:43.366" style="s2">feisty. Kind of like it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.346" end="00:38:43.366" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.520" end="00:38:49.520" style="s2">Elaine, are you insane? You&#39;re my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.079" end="00:38:52.720" style="s2">I have every right to touch you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.520" end="00:38:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soon I won&#39;t be your wife anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.720" end="00:38:59.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that supposed to mean?</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.440" end="00:39:01.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect timing, Jason. I want a divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.839" end="00:39:02.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re divorcing me?</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.119" end="00:39:04.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? You don&#39;t want that? I thought</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.800" end="00:39:06.320" style="s2">you&#39;d be thrilled to give the Mrs. Voss</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.320" end="00:39:08.240" style="s2">title to your late brother&#39;s widow.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.320" end="00:39:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did want a divorce, but since you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.240" end="00:39:12.760" style="s2">the one asking first, I&#39;ve changed my</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.760" end="00:39:12.760" style="s2">mind.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.800" end="00:39:18.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hear me, Elaine? I&#39;m never divorcing</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.359" end="00:39:18.359" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.359" end="00:39:41.200" style="s2">Miss Haley, are you all right?</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.400" end="00:39:42.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, but Jason refuses to sign the</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.200" end="00:39:44.960" style="s2">divorce papers. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.800" end="00:39:46.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No matter. I&#39;ll file a formal lawsuit on</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.960" end="00:39:49.920" style="s2">your behalf. I&#39;ve never lost a case and</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.880" end="00:39:52.480" style="s2">I don&#39;t plan to start now.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.920" end="00:39:56.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Funny. Neither have I.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.480" end="00:39:56.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll make sure he wants this divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.400" end="00:40:09.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, you&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.079" end="00:40:13.240" style="s2">Jason, you&#39;ve been drinking. Come on,</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.599" end="00:40:13.240" style="s2">let&#39;s get you to bed.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.760" end="00:40:19.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll go.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.182" end="00:40:26.858" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.838" end="00:40:26.858" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.457" end="00:40:29.477" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.160" end="00:40:35.720" style="s2">Jason, easy.</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.079" end="00:40:41.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine,</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.520" end="00:40:44.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; he&#39;s calling me Elaine. He&#39;s thinking</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.839" end="00:40:45.760" style="s2">about her. He still hasn&#39;t gotten over</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.160" end="00:40:48.160" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.760" end="00:40:50.560" style="s2">Elaine, he will divorce you. The title</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.160" end="00:40:53.560" style="s2">of Mrs. Voss will be mine and mine</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.560" end="00:40:53.560" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.800" end="00:41:02.480" style="s2">Sarah, you know I hate blueberries in my</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.800" end="00:41:04.240" style="s2">oatmeal. Are you stupid?</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.480" end="00:41:05.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, Mrs. Voss always handled all your</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.240" end="00:41:07.359" style="s2">meals and routines. I really didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.760" end="00:41:09.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why you, Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.359" end="00:41:11.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think Alen really doesn&#39;t want to wait</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.200" end="00:41:15.599" style="s2">on you anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.520" end="00:41:17.119" style="s2">How dare she?</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.599" end="00:41:19.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should go find her and give her a</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.119" end="00:41:21.440" style="s2">piece of your mind. Make her sit there</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.280" end="00:41:26.440" style="s2">and pick every single blueberry out of</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.440" end="00:41:26.440" style="s2">your oatmeal, just like she used to.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.359" end="00:41:34.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, it&#39;s time to head to Peak</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.119" end="00:41:37.680" style="s2">Global. You haven&#39;t been back in five</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.800" end="00:41:42.839" style="s2">whole years.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.680" end="00:41:42.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, 5 years already. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.520" end="00:41:57.079" style="s2">Elaine, I&#39;ll go grab the car.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.079" end="00:41:57.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine,</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.599" end="00:42:02.960" style="s2">what are you two doing here? We&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.280" end="00:42:05.440" style="s2">looking everywhere for you, and here you</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.960" end="00:42:07.680" style="s2">are hiding. Answer me. Why didn&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.440" end="00:42:10.000" style="s2">come home last night? You&#39;ve got some</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.680" end="00:42:12.640" style="s2">nerve walking out on us like that.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.000" end="00:42:15.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t Jason tell you I don&#39;t care about</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.640" end="00:42:18.800" style="s2">this family anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.119" end="00:42:19.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you? Elaine. Mom&#39;s furious and</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.800" end="00:42:22.240" style="s2">she&#39;s going to teach you a little</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.839" end="00:42:25.480" style="s2">lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.240" end="00:42:25.480" style="s2">A lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.880" end="00:42:36.240" style="s2">You know I never eat blueberries in my</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.480" end="00:42:37.839" style="s2">oatmeal. Elaine, now you&#39;re going to sit</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.240" end="00:42:41.240" style="s2">here and pick every single one of them</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.839" end="00:42:41.240" style="s2">out for me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.200" end="00:43:03.280" style="s2">And if I refuse? Oh, don&#39;t be like that.</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.640" end="00:43:07.480" style="s2">You&#39;ve done it a hundred times before.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.280" end="00:43:07.480" style="s2">Well, what are you waiting for, Elaine?</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.079" end="00:43:15.040" style="s2">5 years I poured myself into this family</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.319" end="00:43:18.720" style="s2">and all I got was turned into a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.040" end="00:43:22.000" style="s2">No, I won&#39;t do it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.720" end="00:43:24.079" style="s2">Mom, help. Someone help me. THIS</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.000" end="00:43:27.440" style="s2">HEARTLESS DAUGHTER-IN-LAW IS ABUSING A</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.079" end="00:43:31.040" style="s2">POOR DISABLED old woman.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.440" end="00:43:33.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on here?</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.040" end="00:43:35.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on here? I&#39;m stuck in this</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.680" end="00:43:38.480" style="s2">wheelchair, can barely move, and she</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.839" end="00:43:40.480" style="s2">bullies me every care of me. I&#39;ve had</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.480" end="00:43:42.720" style="s2">such a miserable life, I MIGHT AS WELL</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.480" end="00:43:43.200" style="s2">JUST DIE. She won&#39;t even take care of</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.720" end="00:43:44.240" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.200" end="00:43:46.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.240" end="00:43:48.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s really messed up of you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.000" end="00:43:50.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s family, for heaven&#39;s sake. We all</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.319" end="00:43:52.640" style="s2">get old someday. Have some decency.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.480" end="00:43:54.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is just cruel.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.640" end="00:43:56.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got you right where I want you, Elaine.</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.319" end="00:43:58.240" style="s2">Let&#39;s see you talk your way out of this.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.720" end="00:44:00.990" style="s2">Just pick the blueberries out already,</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.240" end="00:44:03.010" style="s2">Elaine. Save yourself the embarrassment.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.990" end="00:44:03.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.160" end="00:44:09.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.000" end="00:44:36.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There. All done. Every last one. There</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.599" end="00:44:36.119" style="s2">better not be a single berry left.</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.480" end="00:44:51.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nope. They&#39;re all right here.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.240" end="00:44:51.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you eat them.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.839" end="00:45:02.560" style="s2">Elaine, what is wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.960" end="00:45:05.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If mom doesn&#39;t want them, you can have</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.560" end="00:45:05.560" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.359" end="00:45:16.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, that&#39;s no way to treat people.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.560" end="00:45:21.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the bad guy. For 5 years, I ran this</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.520" end="00:45:22.720" style="s2">household. Took care of every single one</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.040" end="00:45:24.000" style="s2">of them.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.720" end="00:45:25.599" style="s2">Then I found out my husband&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.000" end="00:45:27.599" style="s2">cheating with his late brother&#39;s widow</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.599" end="00:45:29.040" style="s2">and she&#39;s pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.599" end="00:45:31.599" style="s2">And this woman right here helped them</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.040" end="00:45:33.680" style="s2">cover it up and bullied me for years. I</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.599" end="00:45:35.839" style="s2">finally stand up for myself and I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.680" end="00:45:37.680" style="s2">villain.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.839" end="00:45:38.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, her son cheated?</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.680" end="00:45:40.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cheated.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.079" end="00:45:42.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His brother&#39;s widow. What a home</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.160" end="00:45:43.280" style="s2">wrecker. That old lady&#39;s awful playing</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.160" end="00:45:46.280" style="s2">the victim like that.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.280" end="00:45:46.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure,</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.480" end="00:45:51.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine. I&#39;ll make my son divorce you for</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.319" end="00:45:52.640" style="s2">this. Just you wait. Go ahead. Call him</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.040" end="00:45:54.000" style="s2">right now. Tell him to get here and sign</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.640" end="00:45:56.079" style="s2">the papers.</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.000" end="00:45:59.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call Jason. Tell him to get over here</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.079" end="00:45:59.079" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.680" end="00:46:06.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s completely lost it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.040" end="00:46:06.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poor thing. She&#39;s just a mean old lady.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.680" end="00:46:23.520" style="s2">Mom, what&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.960" end="00:46:26.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Son, you are divorcing Elaine today. No</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.520" end="00:46:26.520" style="s2">argument.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.920" end="00:46:35.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m not divorcing her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.839" end="00:46:40.212" style="s2">Jason, did you see what she did to your</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.440" end="00:46:40.212" style="s2">mother? [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.240" end="00:46:44.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, what did you do?</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.960" end="00:46:49.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I fed her blueberries. And if you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.440" end="00:46:51.839" style="s2">sign the divorce papers, I&#39;ll make her</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.440" end="00:46:53.280" style="s2">take ice baths. I&#39;ll make her life a</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.839" end="00:46:56.240" style="s2">living hell.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.280" end="00:46:59.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.240" end="00:47:04.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s a crazy, ungrateful housewife.</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.119" end="00:47:04.200" style="s2">Divorce her right now. I</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.240" end="00:47:11.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; if you don&#39;t divorce her, I&#39;ll throw</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.400" end="00:47:11.160" style="s2">myself in THE RIVER. I SWEAR I WILL.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.839" end="00:47:24.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOM, don&#39;t do anything stupid.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.599" end="00:47:24.520" style="s2">Fine, I&#39;ll divorce her.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.280" end="00:47:41.920" style="s2">Think carefully, Elaine. Once we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.119" end="00:47:43.692" style="s2">divorced, you get nothing. No house, no</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.920" end="00:47:45.713" style="s2">car, no money, not a scent.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.692" end="00:47:45.713" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.440" end="00:47:52.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already moved all the money, didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.880" end="00:47:53.599" style="s2">you? Left me with $4.60.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.160" end="00:47:55.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You found out about that.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.599" end="00:47:56.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. I don&#39;t want a single dollar of</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.680" end="00:47:58.400" style="s2">your money.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.319" end="00:47:59.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll end up on the streets begging for</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.400" end="00:48:00.960" style="s2">change.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.119" end="00:48:02.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll see about that. Let&#39;s find out</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.960" end="00:48:05.520" style="s2">which one of us ends up with nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.480" end="00:48:08.079" style="s2">Mr. Voss, Miss Hail, the court has</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.520" end="00:48:10.319" style="s2">reviewed all submitted filings. Before</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.079" end="00:48:11.760" style="s2">we finalize the decree, I must confirm.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.319" end="00:48:13.359" style="s2">Do both of you consent to the</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.760" end="00:48:14.960" style="s2">dissolution of this marriage of your own</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.359" end="00:48:18.440" style="s2">free will?</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.960" end="00:48:18.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, your honor.</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.560" end="00:48:24.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.040" end="00:48:24.440" style="s2">Yes, your honor.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.880" end="00:48:29.720" style="s2">Both parties may now sign the divorce</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.720" end="00:48:29.720" style="s2">decree.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.680" end="00:48:47.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By order of this court, the marriage</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.599" end="00:48:49.599" style="s2">between Mr. Voss and Miss Hail is hereby</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.680" end="00:48:52.599" style="s2">officially dissolved, effective</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.599" end="00:48:52.599" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.920" end="00:49:17.119" style="s2">Jason done.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.160" end="00:49:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.119" end="00:49:23.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And she got nothing, right?</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.000" end="00:49:23.480" style="s2">Not a penny.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.920" end="00:49:30.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Regretting it yet, Elaine?</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.160" end="00:49:34.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all. If anything, I should thank</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.319" end="00:49:36.880" style="s2">you two for making this so easy.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.160" end="00:49:40.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save the tough act, Elaine. You&#39;re broke</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.880" end="00:49:43.040" style="s2">now. You&#39;ve got nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.880" end="00:49:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve lived off Jason for years. Now</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.040" end="00:49:48.079" style="s2">that he&#39;s done with you, you won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.800" end="00:49:51.559" style="s2">survive a week. Then watch closely. See</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.079" end="00:49:51.559" style="s2">what happens next.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.280" end="00:49:59.280" style="s2">Come pick me up.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.920" end="00:50:00.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you calling? Who&#39;s picking you</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.280" end="00:50:04.119" style="s2">up?</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.240" end="00:50:04.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll find out in a second.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.139" end="00:50:09.159" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.069" end="00:50:13.089" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.880" end="00:50:23.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; M.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.440" end="00:50:34.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are all those people? My ride&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.920" end="00:50:34.119" style="s2">here. I&#39;ll be going now.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.359" end="00:50:51.040" style="s2">Why are there so many people picking up</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.960" end="00:50:55.839" style="s2">Elaine? That&#39;s That&#39;s huge.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.040" end="00:50:58.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I swear I heard them call her Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.839" end="00:51:00.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail? But that&#39;s the founder of</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.079" end="00:51:03.119" style="s2">Peak Global. Elaine can&#39;t possibly be.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.880" end="00:51:04.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. If Elaine was the founder of</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.119" end="00:51:06.319" style="s2">Peak Global, why would she play</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.559" end="00:51:08.559" style="s2">housewife for Jason for 5 years? You</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.319" end="00:51:11.200" style="s2">must have miss her.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.559" end="00:51:12.960" style="s2">Jason, you&#39;re divorced now. When are you</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.200" end="00:51:15.119" style="s2">going to marry me? I&#39;m 12 weeks</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.960" end="00:51:17.760" style="s2">pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.119" end="00:51:20.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweet girl. Now you can officially be</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.760" end="00:51:22.559" style="s2">the lady of the Voss household. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.079" end="00:51:24.559" style="s2">from a scholinary family, worlds apart</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.559" end="00:51:27.760" style="s2">from that orphan Elaine.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.559" end="00:51:29.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, we&#39;re not super rich, but my dad&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.760" end="00:51:32.160" style="s2">a college professor and my mom&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.520" end="00:51:33.839" style="s2">famous concert pianist.</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.160" end="00:51:36.640" style="s2">I knew I had a good read on you all</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.839" end="00:51:38.240" style="s2">along. You&#39;re classy and well educated.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.640" end="00:51:39.599" style="s2">Way better than a laid who&#39;s got no</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.240" end="00:51:42.599" style="s2">background and only knows how to do</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.599" end="00:51:42.599" style="s2">housework.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.760" end="00:51:47.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.160" end="00:51:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you marry me, Jason?</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.200" end="00:51:59.760" style="s2">I&#39;ve waited for this. With Rocky gone,</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.000" end="00:52:02.800" style="s2">I&#39;ve always worried about you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.760" end="00:52:04.400" style="s2">We&#39;ll get married.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.800" end="00:52:06.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.400" end="00:52:09.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll hold a proper wedding and no one</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.160" end="00:52:13.079" style="s2">will talk behind your back anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.200" end="00:52:13.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m lucky to have you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.800" end="00:52:19.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look closely, Elaine. See how glamorous</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.359" end="00:52:21.119" style="s2">the Mrs. Voss title is now that you</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.040" end="00:52:24.440" style="s2">threw it away. You&#39;re going to regret</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.119" end="00:52:24.440" style="s2">leaving me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.079" end="00:52:31.960" style="s2">We&#39;ve arrived at peak global.</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.079" end="00:52:45.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5 years. I&#39;m finally home. Shall we head</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.559" end="00:52:45.559" style="s2">inside?</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.359" end="00:53:01.240" style="s2">Elaine, you made it. Everyone&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.920" end="00:53:01.240" style="s2">waiting for you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.480" end="00:53:07.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome home, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.280" end="00:53:11.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail,</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.359" end="00:53:11.240" style="s2">do you still remember us?</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.920" end="00:53:23.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jim, you were my best senior engineer,</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.119" end="00:53:25.520" style="s2">bar none.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.200" end="00:53:28.240" style="s2">It&#39;s me, Miss Hail</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.520" end="00:53:31.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Collins. With you on the team, backend</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.240" end="00:53:32.559" style="s2">analog circuits never had a single bug.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.119" end="00:53:37.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail, [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.559" end="00:53:39.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Larry, James, Allan, you&#39;re all still</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.359" end="00:53:41.520" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.359" end="00:53:43.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still remember all of us. The woman</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.520" end="00:53:46.079" style="s2">who built the Peak Global legend with</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.040" end="00:53:49.200" style="s2">her own two hands, she&#39;s really back. 5</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.079" end="00:53:52.400" style="s2">years you were gone and we waited every</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.200" end="00:53:55.200" style="s2">single day. I gave up Peak Global and</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.400" end="00:53:58.359" style="s2">everything I loved for Jason. I was such</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.200" end="00:53:58.359" style="s2">a fool.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.440" end="00:54:06.960" style="s2">I&#39;m home.</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.640" end="00:54:10.160" style="s2">And together, we&#39;re going to build</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.960" end="00:54:15.240" style="s2">something even greater than before.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.160" end="00:54:15.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We stand with you always, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.760" end="00:54:25.160" style="s2">Attorney Shaw.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.160" end="00:54:33.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.800" end="00:54:43.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Voss. No, excuse me. Miss Hail,</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.640" end="00:54:47.359" style="s2">congratulations on your divorce.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.520" end="00:54:47.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s talk in my office.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.720" end="00:55:02.800" style="s2">Mr. Shaw, the divorce is final. We can</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.720" end="00:55:05.040" style="s2">move on to the next phase.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.800" end="00:55:08.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As a tech upstart, Jason has built up a</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.040" end="00:55:10.240" style="s2">sizable fortune. Domestic assets hit 3.2</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.079" end="00:55:14.680" style="s2">billion, plus two overseas companies.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.240" end="00:55:14.680" style="s2">Total net worth is $3.5 billion.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.200" end="00:55:22.599" style="s2">Every last dollar of it. I&#39;m taking it</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.599" end="00:55:22.599" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.200" end="00:55:27.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail, if I may ask, what&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.000" end="00:55:30.240" style="s2">plan?</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.680" end="00:55:32.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without me, Jason would be nothing. I</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.240" end="00:55:36.400" style="s2">built him up, hand carried him from a</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.800" end="00:55:39.040" style="s2">nobody to the tech tycoon he is today.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.400" end="00:55:43.640" style="s2">And in return, he hid every penny of our</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.040" end="00:55:43.640" style="s2">marital assets, and left me with $4.60.</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.000" end="00:55:49.520" style="s2">It&#39;s time I take back what&#39;s mine. All</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.640" end="00:55:51.040" style="s2">3.5 billion of it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.520" end="00:55:54.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.040" end="00:55:54.760" style="s2">How would you like to proceed?</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.160" end="00:56:02.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ela, you&#39;re not going to believe this.</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.240" end="00:56:05.640" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.160" end="00:56:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, word is you&#39;re getting</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.880" end="00:56:22.799" style="s2">remarried.</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.240" end="00:56:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My divorce is finalized. Now I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.799" end="00:56:27.040" style="s2">throwing a grand once in a life wedding</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.720" end="00:56:28.319" style="s2">for my bride at the Ritz Hotel and</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.040" end="00:56:32.520" style="s2">everyone&#39;s invited.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.319" end="00:56:32.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, Mr. Voss.</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.720" end="00:56:44.200" style="s2">Elaine,</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.319" end="00:56:44.200" style="s2">Jason&#39;s marrying Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.119" end="00:56:56.000" style="s2">It&#39;s Jason. He&#39;s calling you. Miss Hail,</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.319" end="00:56:59.000" style="s2">answer it. Let&#39;s hear what he has to</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.000" end="00:56:59.000" style="s2">say.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.599" end="00:57:05.440" style="s2">What do you want,</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.720" end="00:57:09.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine? I&#39;m getting married and I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.440" end="00:57:09.319" style="s2">formally inviting you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.920" end="00:57:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re getting married and you invited</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.160" end="00:57:18.640" style="s2">your ex-wife.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.000" end="00:57:20.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Too scared to show up?</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.640" end="00:57:21.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why on earth would I be scared?</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.880" end="00:57:24.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you can&#39;t [clears throat] stand</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.760" end="00:57:25.760" style="s2">to see me happy. You&#39;ll be seething with</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.319" end="00:57:27.599" style="s2">jealousy, kicking yourself for letting</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.760" end="00:57:30.640" style="s2">me go.</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.599" end="00:57:32.400" style="s2">Jason, I&#39;ll be there.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.640" end="00:57:34.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That dead beat cheats on you with his</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.400" end="00:57:36.880" style="s2">late brother&#39;s widow, then has the nerve</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.640" end="00:57:39.680" style="s2">to throw a fancy wedding and invite you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.880" end="00:57:42.319" style="s2">He&#39;s just trying to rub it in your face.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.680" end="00:57:46.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I&#39;m going and I&#39;m bringing him a</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.319" end="00:57:46.200" style="s2">very special wedding gift.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.119" end="00:57:52.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of gift?</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.760" end="00:57:56.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m terminating every single partnership</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.000" end="00:57:56.359" style="s2">between Peak Global and Vostech.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.040" end="00:58:01.760" style="s2">Without Peak Global&#39;s backing, Vosttech</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.079" end="00:58:04.880" style="s2">will collapse overnight.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.760" end="00:58:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. I want him to crash and burn. At</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.880" end="00:58:09.599" style="s2">his own wedding, I&#39;m taking back all 3.5</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.440" end="00:58:12.960" style="s2">billion, and I&#39;m knocking him right back</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.599" end="00:58:15.839" style="s2">to the nobody he was 5 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.960" end="00:58:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail, allow me to accompany you to</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.839" end="00:58:21.680" style="s2">the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.880" end="00:58:23.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.680" end="00:58:26.480" style="s2">come on, Elaine. Having him there will</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.440" end="00:58:26.480" style="s2">be a huge help.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.200" end="00:58:31.440" style="s2">All right, Mr. Shaw. I&#39;d appreciate the</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.760" end="00:58:35.559" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.440" end="00:58:35.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It would be my pleasure, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.680" end="00:58:44.720" style="s2">Congratulations, Mr. Boss. Thank you,</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.040" end="00:58:46.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe. I&#39;d like you to meet Mr. Bright</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.720" end="00:58:48.160" style="s2">of Bright Construction and Mr. Hawthorne</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.720" end="00:58:49.839" style="s2">from Hawthorne Realy.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.160" end="00:58:51.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A pleasure to meet you both.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.839" end="00:58:54.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lovely to meet you, Mrs. Voss. You look</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.839" end="00:58:58.520" style="s2">absolutely stunning. We&#39;ll have to do</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.319" end="00:58:58.520" style="s2">dinner sometime, the four of us.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.960" end="00:59:04.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, where are your parents? They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.480" end="00:59:07.960" style="s2">late. I didn&#39;t get to meet them even</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.400" end="00:59:07.960" style="s2">when you wed Rocky.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.720" end="00:59:13.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.119" end="00:59:19.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, your collar&#39;s flipped up.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.839" end="00:59:22.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, first time wearing something this</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.599" end="00:59:24.880" style="s2">nice. Feels weird. Chloe, this place is</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.319" end="00:59:26.160" style="s2">so fancy. Remember who you&#39;re supposed</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.880" end="00:59:29.040" style="s2">to be today.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.160" end="00:59:32.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a university professor</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.040" end="00:59:34.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and I&#39;m a world famous pianist.</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.319" end="00:59:40.040" style="s2">Stick to the story. Act natural and do</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.799" end="00:59:40.040" style="s2">not, I repeat, do not ruin my wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.720" end="00:59:45.200" style="s2">Relax. We got this.</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.680" end="00:59:46.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We plan on living the good life thanks</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.200" end="00:59:49.559" style="s2">to you, kiddo.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.319" end="00:59:49.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon,</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.920" end="00:59:55.920" style="s2">Mr. Mr. Mgan. Mrs. Mgan.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.760" end="00:59:57.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry we&#39;re late. I had a lecture on</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.920" end="01:00:00.480" style="s2">electrical innovation at the university.</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.760" end="01:00:02.160" style="s2">Couldn&#39;t get away.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.480" end="01:00:03.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father&#39;s a professor of electrical</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.160" end="01:00:05.280" style="s2">engineering.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.200" end="01:00:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I just got back from a piano recital</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.280" end="01:00:11.359" style="s2">tour in France, hence the delay. You two</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.400" end="01:00:13.200" style="s2">look so refined and scholarly. Rocky</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.359" end="01:00:15.839" style="s2">passed away young, leaving Chloe all</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.200" end="01:00:18.559" style="s2">alone. She told me you lived overseas</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.839" end="01:00:20.400" style="s2">year round for research and recital. All</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.559" end="01:00:22.480" style="s2">these years, I&#39;ve only wanted Khloe to</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.400" end="01:00:24.000" style="s2">stay part of our family. Jason, you</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.480" end="01:00:26.079" style="s2">should have left Elaine long ago to</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.000" end="01:00:27.760" style="s2">marry her. That girl has no family</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.079" end="01:00:28.720" style="s2">status at all. She never belonged with</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.760" end="01:00:30.799" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.720" end="01:00:32.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My folks hate fancy gatherings and</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.799" end="01:00:35.040" style="s2">barely come home. That&#39;s why I never</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.480" end="01:00:37.359" style="s2">brought them around before.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.040" end="01:00:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has a brother, I think. Run some</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.359" end="01:00:43.520" style="s2">sort of business from what I hear.</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.480" end="01:00:46.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please. Even fruit sailors on the street</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.520" end="01:00:48.240" style="s2">call themselves businessmen these days.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.319" end="01:00:51.119" style="s2">talking about me behind my back again. I</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.240" end="01:00:55.559" style="s2">see.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.119" end="01:00:55.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, it&#39;s Mr. Voda&#39;s ex-wife.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.662" end="01:01:13.760" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.200" end="01:01:17.359" style="s2">Wow, his ex-wife is gorgeous. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.760" end="01:01:19.680" style="s2">prettier than the bride, if you ask me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.359" end="01:01:22.839" style="s2">Somehow Elaine looks more radiant than</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.680" end="01:01:22.839" style="s2">ever before.</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.680" end="01:01:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well, Elaine decided to show up.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.640" end="01:01:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, who is this man? Why&#39;d you bring</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.040" end="01:01:32.880" style="s2">him?</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.520" end="01:01:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never said I couldn&#39;t bring a plus</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.880" end="01:01:38.799" style="s2">one. Jason, he&#39;s my date. Looks like</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.760" end="01:01:40.960" style="s2">Elaine already found herself a new man.</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.799" end="01:01:42.319" style="s2">So, what were we all talking about</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.960" end="01:01:44.480" style="s2">before I arrived?</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.319" end="01:01:46.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Allow me to enlighten you. Mr. Mr. Mkin</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.480" end="01:01:49.599" style="s2">is a university professor. Mrs. Merson a</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.640" end="01:01:53.839" style="s2">renowned pianist. A proper respectable</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.599" end="01:01:55.760" style="s2">family. The kind worthy of our son.</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.839" end="01:01:58.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that so though?</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.760" end="01:02:00.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.880" end="01:02:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just curious. How does a respectable</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.799" end="01:02:05.760" style="s2">family raise a homeer like Chloe?</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.520" end="01:02:08.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you?</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.760" end="01:02:11.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two look awfully familiar. Have we</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.880" end="01:02:12.640" style="s2">met before?</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.280" end="01:02:15.520" style="s2">As if you&#39;d ever move in the same</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.640" end="01:02:18.079" style="s2">circles. Who do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.520" end="01:02:20.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Attorney Shaw? It&#39;s been far too long.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.079" end="01:02:21.920" style="s2">Mr. Hawthorne, good to see you. Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.079" end="01:02:24.079" style="s2">Voss, this is Sha Shaw, founding partner</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.920" end="01:02:24.480" style="s2">of Sha Partners LLT, the top firm in the</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.079" end="01:02:26.160" style="s2">country.</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.480" end="01:02:27.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The undefeated Attorney Shaw. I&#39;ve heard</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.160" end="01:02:31.640" style="s2">so much about you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.920" end="01:02:31.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s attorney Shaw.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.200" end="01:02:37.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait a minute. Did I see you two at a</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.599" end="01:02:40.319" style="s2">criminal trial? Have you served time in</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.760" end="01:02:41.760" style="s2">prison?</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.319" end="01:02:44.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prison?</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.760" end="01:02:47.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Going to go back. That&#39;s a lie. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.240" end="01:02:50.160" style="s2">never been to prison a day in my life.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.280" end="01:02:52.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason. Mom. Elaine&#39;s just jealous. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.160" end="01:02:54.319" style="s2">making all this up to ruin my day. How</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.319" end="01:02:56.160" style="s2">did Elaine land attorney Shaw? They</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.319" end="01:02:56.799" style="s2">can&#39;t find out about Mom and Dad&#39;s past.</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.160" end="01:02:59.119" style="s2">Not today.</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.799" end="01:03:00.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. My in-laws would never be common</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.119" end="01:03:02.720" style="s2">criminals.</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.960" end="01:03:03.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw, do you actually recognize</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.720" end="01:03:04.480" style="s2">them?</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.119" end="01:03:05.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can pull up their records when I get</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.480" end="01:03:06.400" style="s2">back to the office. We&#39;ll know for sure</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.839" end="01:03:08.880" style="s2">then.</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.400" end="01:03:10.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do it. Jealous?</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.880" end="01:03:12.319" style="s2">What exactly would I be jealous of?</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.799" end="01:03:14.400" style="s2">You&#39;re jealous that Jason threw me a</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.319" end="01:03:18.520" style="s2">dream wedding at the Ricks with all our</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.400" end="01:03:18.520" style="s2">friends and family here to celebrate.</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.640" end="01:03:24.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.720" end="01:03:29.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.558" end="01:03:30.960" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.280" end="01:03:33.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, I&#39;m just a broke kid right now.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.960" end="01:03:35.359" style="s2">I can&#39;t afford a real wedding. But give</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.039" end="01:03:36.640" style="s2">me a few years. When I make it big, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.359" end="01:03:38.640" style="s2">throw you the grandest wedding the</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.640" end="01:03:40.160" style="s2">city&#39;s ever seen at the fanciest hotel.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.640" end="01:03:42.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you the happiest bride in the</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.160" end="01:03:45.000" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.000" end="01:03:45.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.280" end="01:03:53.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believed every word he said that day.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.480" end="01:03:55.039" style="s2">I waited 5 years</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.359" end="01:03:57.359" style="s2">and now that dream wedding is finally</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.039" end="01:04:00.839" style="s2">happening. But I&#39;m not the bride.</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.359" end="01:04:00.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring it in.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.839" end="01:04:09.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that a ribbon? Mrs. Voss, what is</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.559" end="01:04:12.000" style="s2">this for? at a wedding. This is a Voss</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.680" end="01:04:14.079" style="s2">family tradition. Cutting this ribbon</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.000" end="01:04:16.480" style="s2">symbolizes a clean break once and for</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.079" end="01:04:18.480" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.480" end="01:04:20.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who exactly is supposed to cut it?</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.480" end="01:04:22.240" style="s2">For 5 years, Elaine has been nothing but</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.319" end="01:04:24.160" style="s2">a dead weight, living off my son&#39;s hard</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.240" end="01:04:26.000" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.160" end="01:04:28.000" style="s2">He built everything from the ground up,</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.000" end="01:04:29.839" style="s2">all while carrying her along. It&#39;s long</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.000" end="01:04:32.079" style="s2">past time she was cut out of the Voss</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.839" end="01:04:33.839" style="s2">family for good. Today, on my son&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.079" end="01:04:35.440" style="s2">wedding day, you will cut this ribbon in</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.839" end="01:04:37.520" style="s2">front of everyone. And from this moment</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.440" end="01:04:40.160" style="s2">on, you will have no ties to the boss</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.520" end="01:04:41.280" style="s2">family. None.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.160" end="01:04:42.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, [snorts] you want me to publicly</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.280" end="01:04:44.559" style="s2">admit I was thrown out?</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.480" end="01:04:46.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she wrong, Elaine? 5 years of</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.559" end="01:04:47.119" style="s2">marriage and you contributed nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.000" end="01:04:48.079" style="s2">You haven&#39;t earned the right to carry</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.119" end="01:04:49.599" style="s2">the boss name.</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.079" end="01:04:51.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without you holding him back, Jason</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.599" end="01:04:54.319" style="s2">would have been a success years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.839" end="01:04:55.599" style="s2">Just cut the ribbon already, Elaine.</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.319" end="01:04:59.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.599" end="01:04:59.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit stalling.</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.319" end="01:05:05.720" style="s2">And if I refuse,</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.720" end="01:05:05.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; security,</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.839" end="01:05:11.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; if you won&#39;t do it yourself, we&#39;ll hold</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.440" end="01:05:11.480" style="s2">you down and cut it for you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.079" end="01:05:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d like to see someone try.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.680" end="01:05:18.000" style="s2">Threatening. Go on, lay a hand on her</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.680" end="01:05:19.520" style="s2">and find out what happens.</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.000" end="01:05:24.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, what are you waiting for? Hold her</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.520" end="01:05:24.440" style="s2">down. Mr. Shaw, it&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.319" end="01:05:34.400" style="s2">So, this is the little stunt you planned</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.760" end="01:05:37.960" style="s2">for my wedding invite. Fine. Let&#39;s see</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.400" end="01:05:37.960" style="s2">how you like this.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.559" end="01:05:48.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, what is wrong with you? Have you</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.799" end="01:05:50.880" style="s2">lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.480" end="01:05:52.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not the crazy one here, Jason. Did</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.880" end="01:05:54.640" style="s2">you actually believe you built all this</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.319" end="01:05:55.839" style="s2">yourself over the last 5 years? Then why</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.640" end="01:06:01.559" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t I?</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.839" end="01:06:01.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wake up, Jason. It&#39;s over. Bring it up.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.400" end="01:06:07.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Read it and read.</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.680" end="01:06:09.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The termination of partnership</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.039" end="01:06:11.599" style="s2">agreements.</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.680" end="01:06:12.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pete Global is cutting all ties with Bot</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.599" end="01:06:14.480" style="s2">Tech.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.000" end="01:06:17.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You read that correctly. Every last</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.480" end="01:06:21.960" style="s2">partnership is terminated. Consider it</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.119" end="01:06:21.960" style="s2">my wedding gift to you. Like it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.760" end="01:06:29.799" style="s2">This can&#39;t be real. Peak Global can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.680" end="01:06:29.799" style="s2">just drop Voss Group like this.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.000" end="01:06:32.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve been our biggest partner for</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.359" end="01:06:34.319" style="s2">years. They believed in us. Why would</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.880" end="01:06:37.280" style="s2">they pull out now?</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.319" end="01:06:40.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what this is. That contract&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.280" end="01:06:40.280" style="s2">fake.</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.359" end="01:06:46.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you, Elaine? Parading around</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.680" end="01:06:47.680" style="s2">with a fake contract just to scare us.</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.160" end="01:06:52.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would you even have a peak global</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.680" end="01:06:52.280" style="s2">contract? Exactly. It has to be fake.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.760" end="01:07:00.160" style="s2">Mr. Boss.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.760" end="01:07:01.920" style="s2">Derek, what&#39;s going on? It&#39;s bad, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.160" end="01:07:03.200" style="s2">Peak Global just officially terminated</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.920" end="01:07:04.960" style="s2">every single partnership, and they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.200" end="01:07:06.960" style="s2">pulling all 12 core chip patents.</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.960" end="01:07:09.200" style="s2">Effective immediately. What did you just</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.960" end="01:07:10.559" style="s2">say? The news already went public. Our</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.200" end="01:07:12.799" style="s2">stock hit the trading halt limit, and</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.559" end="01:07:16.240" style="s2">partners are bailing left and right. Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.799" end="01:07:19.240" style="s2">Voss, Vostech is collapsing.</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.240" end="01:07:19.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Collapsing?</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.760" end="01:07:25.200" style="s2">Still think this contract&#39;s fake, Jason?</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.359" end="01:07:26.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s real.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.200" end="01:07:28.400" style="s2">It&#39;s all real.</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.319" end="01:07:30.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That $3 billion techy lacon life was</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.400" end="01:07:33.880" style="s2">always a pipe dream. And now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.640" end="01:07:33.880" style="s2">waking up.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.240" end="01:07:39.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Peak Global dropped Vos Tech.</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.039" end="01:07:40.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s going to go bankrupt. We need to</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.200" end="01:07:42.880" style="s2">get far away from him. We can&#39;t afford</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.720" end="01:07:44.559" style="s2">to cross a giant like Peak Global.</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.880" end="01:07:47.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, we&#39;ve got a prior engagement.</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.559" end="01:07:49.039" style="s2">We&#39;ll be going.</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.599" end="01:07:51.440" style="s2">WAIT, DON&#39;T LEAVE.</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.039" end="01:07:53.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAIT, IT&#39;S MY WEDDING DAY. COME BACK.</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.440" end="01:07:55.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did this happen? Why is this</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.839" end="01:07:57.760" style="s2">happening?</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.839" end="01:08:01.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw, we&#39;re done here.</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.760" end="01:08:01.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.720" end="01:08:07.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine. Elaine.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.240" end="01:08:17.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where you next, Miss Hail?</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.799" end="01:08:19.520" style="s2">Back to headquarters.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.440" end="01:08:21.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine. Elaine. Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.520" end="01:08:22.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Boss. So, what do I owe the</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.279" end="01:08:23.120" style="s2">pleasure? Worried you&#39;ll catch bad luck</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.560" end="01:08:25.279" style="s2">from me?</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.120" end="01:08:27.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, why do you have a Peak Global</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.279" end="01:08:28.319" style="s2">termination contract?</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.120" end="01:08:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a guess.</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.319" end="01:08:30.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is your connection to Peak Global?</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.920" end="01:08:34.679" style="s2">Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.799" end="01:08:34.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Again, drive.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.719" end="01:08:37.719" style="s2">Els</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.799" end="01:08:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, are you actually going to go</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.799" end="01:08:50.239" style="s2">bankrupt?</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.000" end="01:08:51.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We will if we can&#39;t fix this. Our cash</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.239" end="01:08:54.000" style="s2">flow&#39;s already dried up.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.839" end="01:08:55.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it. You&#39;re going to be a nobody</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.000" end="01:08:56.799" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.279" end="01:08:59.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe,</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.799" end="01:09:01.679" style="s2">I signed up to marry a $3 billion tech</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.199" end="01:09:04.159" style="s2">tycoon, not a broke loser. I am not</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.679" end="01:09:05.759" style="s2">going back to living poor.</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.159" end="01:09:07.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do something. Fix this.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.759" end="01:09:10.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying, but I don&#39;t even know why</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.679" end="01:09:12.799" style="s2">Pete Global pulled the log on us.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.239" end="01:09:14.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, I got Mr. Hill&#39;s phone number.</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.799" end="01:09:17.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call him right now. Ask him what&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.560" end="01:09:17.560" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.520" end="01:09:26.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, that&#39;s done at the wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.759" end="01:09:26.759" style="s2">Cool.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.600" end="01:09:29.120" style="s2">Is</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.759" end="01:09:32.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; that deadbeat? Jason,</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.120" end="01:09:32.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; answer it.</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.480" end="01:09:35.600" style="s2">Mr. Voss.</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.839" end="01:09:37.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Hail, can you at least tell me why</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.600" end="01:09:42.359" style="s2">this is happening?</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.120" end="01:09:42.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, you offended my sister.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.319" end="01:09:48.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail, that&#39;s right,</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.560" end="01:09:53.600" style="s2">Miss Hail. I ran a background check on</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.319" end="01:09:55.280" style="s2">Khloe&#39;s parents.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.600" end="01:09:56.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what did you find?</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.280" end="01:09:58.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re career con artists. They were</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.960" end="01:10:00.159" style="s2">convicted of a major white collars fraud</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.560" end="01:10:01.360" style="s2">scheme a few years back. and we&#39;ve just</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.159" end="01:10:02.719" style="s2">got out of prison.</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.360" end="01:10:04.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Khloe&#39;s the daughter of two</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.719" end="01:10:05.760" style="s2">convicted con artists.</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.320" end="01:10:06.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He walked right into their con, didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.760" end="01:10:08.560" style="s2">he?</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.800" end="01:10:11.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This just got a lot more interesting.</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.560" end="01:10:13.760" style="s2">Thank you, Mr. Shaw. I appreciate this.</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.760" end="01:10:15.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you really mean that, how about</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.760" end="01:10:16.800" style="s2">dinner with me tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.199" end="01:10:19.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. Lou, you&#39;re coming, too.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.800" end="01:10:22.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, no can do. I&#39;ve got plans tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.440" end="01:10:22.440" style="s2">Enjoy.</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.679" end="01:10:31.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39; Mr. Hail say</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.480" end="01:10:36.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; he said I offended Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.560" end="01:10:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve never even met Miss Hail. How</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.400" end="01:10:39.920" style="s2">could we have offended her?</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.000" end="01:10:41.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to Peak Global right now. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.920" end="01:10:44.360" style="s2">going to apologize to Miss Hail in</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.360" end="01:10:44.360" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.640" end="01:10:50.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologize. It&#39;s our only option.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.840" end="01:10:52.719" style="s2">We have to beg Miss Hail for mercy.</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.560" end="01:10:54.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait here for me. I&#39;ll drop you off</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.719" end="01:10:57.360" style="s2">later.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.560" end="01:11:00.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.360" end="01:11:02.400" style="s2">Let&#39;s go, Derek.</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.239" end="01:11:04.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been too much today. My head&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.400" end="01:11:07.400" style="s2">killing me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.400" end="01:11:07.400" style="s2">Chloe,</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.960" end="01:11:14.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, I&#39;m talking to you. Do you hear</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.760" end="01:11:16.560" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.239" end="01:11:19.280" style="s2">I heard you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.560" end="01:11:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, come help me then.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.280" end="01:11:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would I? You think I&#39;m Elaine? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.520" end="01:11:26.800" style="s2">not your personal maid. Chloe,</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.800" end="01:11:27.920" style="s2">you never acted like this before.</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.800" end="01:11:29.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like what?</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.920" end="01:11:31.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were so sweet and obedient. You</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.840" end="01:11:32.719" style="s2">never dared to talk back to me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.199" end="01:11:34.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, I was nice when Jason had</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.719" end="01:11:37.120" style="s2">money. But now he&#39;s offended Miss Hail</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.960" end="01:11:38.560" style="s2">and he&#39;s going to go broke. Why would I</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.120" end="01:11:42.239" style="s2">bother?</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.560" end="01:11:45.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You little</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.239" end="01:11:45.560" style="s2">my head.</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.960" end="01:12:01.440" style="s2">Chloe, if he really does go broke, this</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.199" end="01:12:04.080" style="s2">place is full of expensive stuff. We</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.440" end="01:12:07.760" style="s2">should grab what we can and go.</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.080" end="01:12:11.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need a backup plan now.</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.760" end="01:12:11.560" style="s2">Jason has a safe.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.239" end="01:12:17.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A safe? Where is it?</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.520" end="01:12:21.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the bedroom.</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.760" end="01:12:21.560" style="s2">Lead the way. Hurry.</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.239" end="01:12:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, where&#39;s this safe?</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.320" end="01:12:39.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s right here. But Jason never told me</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.480" end="01:12:41.199" style="s2">the combination.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.040" end="01:12:43.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little safe won&#39;t stop me. Forgot what</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.199" end="01:12:46.760" style="s2">I used to do for a living.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.040" end="01:12:46.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, stand back.</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.080" end="01:12:55.920" style="s2">Can you get it open?</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.080" end="01:12:59.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.920" end="01:12:59.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit rushing me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.480" end="01:13:05.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We got it.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.895" end="01:13:15.159" style="s2">[snorts] Diamonds,</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.760" end="01:13:15.159" style="s2">jewelry, and a bear bank check.</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.760" end="01:13:23.520" style="s2">How much is it worth?</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.480" end="01:13:25.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 800 million.</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.520" end="01:13:30.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 800 million? We&#39;re rich.</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.920" end="01:13:30.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry. Pack it all up and let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.400" end="01:13:41.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.336" end="01:13:41.199" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.040" end="01:13:43.760" style="s2">What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.199" end="01:13:46.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the old bat doing here? You broke into</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.760" end="01:13:49.640" style="s2">Jason&#39;s safe. Give everything back right</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.640" end="01:13:49.640" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.840" end="01:13:53.440" style="s2">This stuff is ours now. You&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.920" end="01:13:55.920" style="s2">getting any of it back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.440" end="01:13:56.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thieves. You&#39;re all nothing but common</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.920" end="01:14:00.679" style="s2">thieves.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.800" end="01:14:00.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s get out of here now.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.440" end="01:14:06.640" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE NOT GOING ANYWHERE. LEAVE</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.600" end="01:14:10.320" style="s2">EVERYTHING HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.640" end="01:14:13.320" style="s2">Let go of me, you old hag.</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.320" end="01:14:13.320" style="s2">Never.</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.920" end="01:14:17.560" style="s2">Then go to hell,</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.946" end="01:14:24.880" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.800" end="01:14:28.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ma&#39;am. What happened? [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.880" end="01:14:28.120" style="s2">Move it.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.920" end="01:14:34.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, talk to me. What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.356" end="01:14:37.440" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.719" end="01:14:38.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let Chloe get away. Stop her,</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.440" end="01:14:41.040" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.560" end="01:14:42.719" style="s2">Chloe. But isn&#39;t it her wedding day?</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.040" end="01:14:44.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was so wrong about her. Everything</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.719" end="01:14:46.640" style="s2">fell apart the second Jason married her.</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.719" end="01:14:49.040" style="s2">For 5 years, Elaine ran this house</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.640" end="01:14:50.880" style="s2">perfectly. I regret it all. I regret</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.040" end="01:14:52.800" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.880" end="01:14:54.880" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, you finally see how good she was</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.800" end="01:14:57.120" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.880" end="01:15:00.480" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.120" end="01:15:05.000" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.480" end="01:15:05.000" style="s2">Ma&#39;am. Ma&#39;am, wake up.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.760" end="01:15:15.040" style="s2">Hello. I need to speak with Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.560" end="01:15:17.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello. Do you have an appointment?</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.040" end="01:15:19.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have one, but I&#39;m Jason Voss,</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.360" end="01:15:20.320" style="s2">CEO of Voss Tech. Please tell her I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.120" end="01:15:22.640" style="s2">here. I need to see her.</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.320" end="01:15:24.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re Jason Voss. Peak Global has</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.640" end="01:15:26.480" style="s2">terminated all partnerships with Voss</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.080" end="01:15:28.719" style="s2">Group. Miss Hail will not see you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.480" end="01:15:30.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just go tell her I&#39;m here, please. She</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.719" end="01:15:34.920" style="s2">might agree to see me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.480" end="01:15:34.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, you need to leave.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.040" end="01:15:41.679" style="s2">Miss Hail. Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.920" end="01:15:43.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, please lower your voice. This</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.679" end="01:15:45.040" style="s2">is a professional space. Keep this up</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.520" end="01:15:48.040" style="s2">and I&#39;ll call security to escort you</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.040" end="01:15:48.040" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.992" end="01:15:53.120" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.520" end="01:15:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail, I&#39;m here to apologize</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.120" end="01:15:59.000" style="s2">sincerely. I don&#39;t know how I offended</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.960" end="01:15:59.000" style="s2">you, but I want to make it right.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.719" end="01:16:13.880" style="s2">Oh my god, the CEO of Voss Group just</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.600" end="01:16:13.880" style="s2">knelt down in the middle of the lobby.</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.320" end="01:16:23.840" style="s2">Mr. Voss, what is the meaning of this?</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.040" end="01:16:27.280" style="s2">Mr. Hail, you said I offended Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.840" end="01:16:28.960" style="s2">I&#39;m here to apologize to her. Mr. Voss,</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.280" end="01:16:30.640" style="s2">do you even know how you hurt my sister?</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.960" end="01:16:32.000" style="s2">I don&#39;t know. Elaine brought that</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.640" end="01:16:33.440" style="s2">termination contract. I don&#39;t know how</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.000" end="01:16:34.960" style="s2">she wiggled her way into Miss Hail&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.440" end="01:16:36.000" style="s2">good hares, but she&#39;s just a housewife.</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.960" end="01:16:38.239" style="s2">She&#39;s trying to ruin me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.000" end="01:16:41.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, that&#39;s what you tell yourself. Go</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.239" end="01:16:43.199" style="s2">let Miss Hail know he&#39;s here. Fine,</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.040" end="01:16:46.840" style="s2">Jason. Today, you&#39;ll get to meet my</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.199" end="01:16:46.840" style="s2">sister face to face.</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.000" end="01:16:55.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail, what would you like for</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.440" end="01:16:57.120" style="s2">dinner tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.120" end="01:16:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything works for me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.120" end="01:17:01.400" style="s2">I&#39;ll have my assistant make a</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.400" end="01:17:01.400" style="s2">reservation.</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.400" end="01:17:05.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Hail,</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.760" end="01:17:12.840" style="s2">what is it? Miss Hail. Jason Voss is</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.159" end="01:17:12.840" style="s2">here. He&#39;s kneeling in the lobby.</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.080" end="01:17:17.719" style="s2">Let&#39;s go see this.</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.280" end="01:17:26.760" style="s2">Mr. Voss,</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.280" end="01:17:26.760" style="s2">here I am.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.280" end="01:17:36.560" style="s2">Miss Hail. Elaine,</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.520" end="01:17:37.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; it&#39;s me. It can&#39;t be you. I came to see</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.560" end="01:17:39.199" style="s2">Mrs. Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.199" end="01:17:41.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully, Jason. My name is</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.199" end="01:17:42.960" style="s2">Elaine Hail. I founded Peak Global. I am</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.679" end="01:17:45.960" style="s2">the Miss Hail you&#39;ve been begging to</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.960" end="01:17:45.960" style="s2">see.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.719" end="01:17:54.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Voss is Miss Hail. Elaine, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.040" end="01:17:55.679" style="s2">Miss Hail. No, that&#39;s impossible. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.239" end="01:17:57.920" style="s2">lying.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.679" end="01:18:00.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your tongue. You will show Miss</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.920" end="01:18:02.800" style="s2">Hail respect.</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.800" end="01:18:07.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason,</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.800" end="01:18:08.560" style="s2">she is my sister. It can&#39;t be true. I</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.120" end="01:18:10.640" style="s2">won&#39;t believe it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.560" end="01:18:13.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t believe me? Let me spell it</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.640" end="01:18:15.760" style="s2">out for you. 5 years ago, I built Peak</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.600" end="01:18:17.280" style="s2">Global from nothing. At the very top of</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.760" end="01:18:19.360" style="s2">my career, I believed your lies and</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.280" end="01:18:21.120" style="s2">married you. I gave everything up to be</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.360" end="01:18:23.120" style="s2">your housewife.</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.120" end="01:18:24.239" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.120" end="01:18:26.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; did. Did you really think you built all</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.239" end="01:18:28.480" style="s2">this on your own? How laughable.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.560" end="01:18:30.239" style="s2">Thousands of kids have big dreams. Why</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.480" end="01:18:32.000" style="s2">did you succeed? Because I handed you</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.239" end="01:18:33.760" style="s2">the patents and the partnerships. All of</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.000" end="01:18:39.320" style="s2">it came from Peak Global.</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.760" end="01:18:39.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was you. All of it was you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.080" end="01:18:45.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what did I get in return after 5</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.600" end="01:18:49.040" style="s2">years? A cheating husband who slept with</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.920" end="01:18:52.679" style="s2">his late brother&#39;s widow. And $4.60 left</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.040" end="01:18:52.679" style="s2">in our joint account.</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.960" end="01:18:57.239" style="s2">That&#39;s how you repay me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.199" end="01:19:09.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true. You really are, Mrs. Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.400" end="01:19:11.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, I was against this from the</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.840" end="01:19:13.360" style="s2">start. I never approved of you marrying</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.840" end="01:19:15.760" style="s2">my sister when you had nothing. And look</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.360" end="01:19:19.280" style="s2">at you now. You proved me right.</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.760" end="01:19:22.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, no. Miss Hail, I&#39;m sorry for</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.280" end="01:19:23.840" style="s2">everything. I came here to apologize.</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.400" end="01:19:25.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologize?</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.840" end="01:19:28.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hit me. Yell at me. Do whatever you</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.679" end="01:19:30.400" style="s2">want. I deserve it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.560" end="01:19:32.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mrs. Hail. Whatever it takes to</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.400" end="01:19:36.760" style="s2">make this right.</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.159" end="01:19:36.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do deserve to be taught a lesson.</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.600" end="01:19:52.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you hit me?</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.239" end="01:19:55.310" style="s2">Why would I waste the effort?</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.960" end="01:19:55.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hitting you would only hurt my hand.</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.310" end="01:19:57.520" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.760" end="01:19:59.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do you plan to do with me?</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.520" end="01:20:01.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, I know you better than you know</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.520" end="01:20:03.600" style="s2">yourself. You haven&#39;t realized you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.520" end="01:20:06.960" style="s2">wrong. You&#39;re just scared now that Pete</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.600" end="01:20:08.719" style="s2">Global pulled the plug on Voss Tech.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.960" end="01:20:11.520" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that right,</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.719" end="01:20:14.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Hail? Can&#39;t Pete Global keep</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.520" end="01:20:16.239" style="s2">working with Vos Group?</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.320" end="01:20:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.239" end="01:20:20.320" style="s2">I&#39;m taking everything back.</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.880" end="01:20:25.000" style="s2">You&#39;re going right back to being the</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.320" end="01:20:25.000" style="s2">penniles nobody you were 5 years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.719" end="01:20:31.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, do you have to be this cruel?</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.120" end="01:20:35.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were cruel first. I will never</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.840" end="01:20:38.159" style="s2">forgive your lies and your betrayal.</p>
<p begin="01:20:35.280" end="01:20:41.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Have it your way. This isn&#39;t over,</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.159" end="01:20:41.159" style="s2">Elaine.</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.840" end="01:20:48.960" style="s2">Miss Hail, it looks like Jason still</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.440" end="01:20:50.480" style="s2">thinks he can fight this.</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.960" end="01:20:53.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw, I&#39;m going to have to rain</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.480" end="01:20:55.840" style="s2">check our dinner tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.040" end="01:20:57.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is something wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.840" end="01:21:00.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t let Jason Boss dig his way out</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.679" end="01:21:03.040" style="s2">of this.</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.719" end="01:21:04.320" style="s2">Call an emergency meeting immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.040" end="01:21:07.320" style="s2">We&#39;re discussing the acquisition of</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.320" end="01:21:07.320" style="s2">Vostech.</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.800" end="01:21:13.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, you&#39;re buying Vastec</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.120" end="01:21:14.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and Mr. Shaw, keep a close eye on Chloe</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.360" end="01:21:17.560" style="s2">and her family.</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.560" end="01:21:17.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great.</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.880" end="01:21:26.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail,</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.440" end="01:21:29.800" style="s2">I&#39;m free whenever you are.</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.480" end="01:21:29.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait.</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.360" end="01:21:34.719" style="s2">Mr. Voss, you shouldn&#39;t have walked away</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.800" end="01:21:36.640" style="s2">like that. Not when she holds all the</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.719" end="01:21:38.719" style="s2">cards. I&#39;ll find a way to save Voss</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.640" end="01:21:42.440" style="s2">group. [snorts] I refuse to believe I</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.719" end="01:21:42.440" style="s2">can&#39;t succeed without Elaine.</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.760" end="01:21:48.920" style="s2">Sir, you need to get to the hospital</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.679" end="01:21:48.920" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.246" end="01:21:53.266" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.159" end="01:22:00.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, thank goodness you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.040" end="01:22:01.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened to my mom?</p>
<p begin="01:22:00.159" end="01:22:04.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all Khloe&#39;s fault.</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.920" end="01:22:06.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe?</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.560" end="01:22:09.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about Chloe? My mom&#39;s in the</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.239" end="01:22:11.520" style="s2">hospital. Where is she? Sir, I got home</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.120" end="01:22:13.440" style="s2">and found ma&#39;am on the floor. Khloe was</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.520" end="01:22:15.600" style="s2">just standing there watching. She didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.440" end="01:22:17.920" style="s2">help at all. She just ran off. I think</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.600" end="01:22:19.840" style="s2">she pushed her.</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.920" end="01:22:21.280" style="s2">That&#39;s outrageous.</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.840" end="01:22:24.280" style="s2">Derek, find out where Chloe is right</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.280" end="01:22:24.280" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.840" end="01:22:32.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re rich. We&#39;re actually rich.</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.840" end="01:22:34.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With 800 million, we&#39;ll live like kings</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.320" end="01:22:37.600" style="s2">for the rest of our lives.</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.639" end="01:22:39.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad. Mom. Jason will figure out we broke</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.600" end="01:22:42.320" style="s2">into his safe sooner or later. We need</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.280" end="01:22:43.840" style="s2">to get out of the country fast.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.320" end="01:22:46.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.840" end="01:22:49.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.480" end="01:22:52.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open the door right now.</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.199" end="01:22:54.837" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Jason. Hide everything now.</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.817" end="01:22:54.837" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.400" end="01:23:00.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.480" end="01:23:02.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, tell me the truth. Did you push</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.560" end="01:23:03.840" style="s2">my mom? She&#39;s in the hospital</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.159" end="01:23:06.320" style="s2">unconscious.</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.840" end="01:23:08.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. He doesn&#39;t know for sure.</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.320" end="01:23:10.239" style="s2">Jason, I would never. Mom was worried</p>
<p begin="01:23:08.480" end="01:23:11.920" style="s2">sick about you. She tripped and fell on</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.239" end="01:23:14.480" style="s2">her own. I was just about to help her up</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.920" end="01:23:15.840" style="s2">when Sarah walked in. Hey, did you get</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.480" end="01:23:19.840" style="s2">to meet Mrs. Hail?</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.840" end="01:23:23.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did. Elaine is Mrs. Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.840" end="01:23:23.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.840" end="01:23:29.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine is Mrs. Hail. Elaine founded Peak</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.199" end="01:23:32.400" style="s2">Global this whole time. Jason, how did</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.360" end="01:23:35.040" style="s2">it go?</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.400" end="01:23:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Peak Global&#39;s cutting all ties. Elaine&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.040" end="01:23:39.323" style="s2">going to drag me right back to being the</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.480" end="01:23:41.280" style="s2">broke nobody I was 5 years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.323" end="01:23:44.159" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.280" end="01:23:46.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it. We&#39;re ruined.</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.159" end="01:23:48.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason&#39;s useless now. Time to squeeze</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.800" end="01:23:50.800" style="s2">every last drop of value out of him</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.480" end="01:23:54.000" style="s2">before I bail.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.800" end="01:23:55.760" style="s2">Jason, I have a way to save Vos Group.</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.000" end="01:23:57.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.760" end="01:24:00.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We left in such a hurry earlier because</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.600" end="01:24:02.639" style="s2">we were working on a solution for you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.239" end="01:24:04.480" style="s2">Dad&#39;s star student is Dean Crawford over</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.639" end="01:24:06.880" style="s2">at Horizon Bank.</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.480" end="01:24:09.440" style="s2">He&#39;s willing to approve a $1 billion</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.880" end="01:24:12.728" style="s2">loan for you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.440" end="01:24:13.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re serious?</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.728" end="01:24:14.800" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.040" end="01:24:15.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I swallowed my pride and called in a</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.800" end="01:24:17.199" style="s2">huge favor for you, son.</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.920" end="01:24:19.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s never asked one of his former</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.199" end="01:24:20.960" style="s2">students for anything before.</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.360" end="01:24:24.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, all of you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.960" end="01:24:24.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re family, aren&#39;t we?</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.520" end="01:24:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, all you have to do is sign right</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.239" end="01:24:35.653" style="s2">here and the billion dollars will hit</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.040" end="01:24:36.639" style="s2">VST&#39;s account immediately. Our</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.653" end="01:24:38.560" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.639" end="01:24:40.480" style="s2">biggest problem right now is cash flow.</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.560" end="01:24:41.520" style="s2">With a billion dollars injected, Vostech</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.480" end="01:24:44.239" style="s2">will pull through.</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.520" end="01:24:46.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry up and sign. Jason,</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.239" end="01:24:46.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; this is a perfect chance. Don&#39;t waste</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.320" end="01:24:50.000" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.960" end="01:24:51.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign it and Voss Group is saved.</p>
<p begin="01:24:50.000" end="01:24:56.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, something feels off about</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.840" end="01:24:56.440" style="s2">this. Let legal review it first.</p>
<p begin="01:24:57.360" end="01:25:01.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, what is that supposed to mean?</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.120" end="01:25:02.960" style="s2">You think I&#39;d hurt Jason?</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.280" end="01:25:03.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t say that.</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.960" end="01:25:06.080" style="s2">You did.</p>
<p begin="01:25:03.920" end="01:25:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you, Jason? I&#39;m carrying your</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.080" end="01:25:09.280" style="s2">baby and I&#39;m only trying to help you.</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.440" end="01:25:10.639" style="s2">Elaine wants to leave you with nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.280" end="01:25:12.480" style="s2">Don&#39;t let her win.</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.639" end="01:25:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, I&#39;m going to prove to you I can</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.480" end="01:25:18.159" style="s2">make it on my own without you.</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.440" end="01:25:19.440" style="s2">Give me the pen.</p>
<p begin="01:25:18.159" end="01:25:23.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right here, Jason.</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.440" end="01:25:23.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, wait.</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.760" end="01:25:30.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just sit tight and wait for the</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.120" end="01:25:30.600" style="s2">money to come through.</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.600" end="01:25:37.679" style="s2">Derek, has the loan come through yet?</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.000" end="01:25:40.480" style="s2">Not yet, sir. We haven&#39;t heard a single</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.679" end="01:25:43.120" style="s2">thing since you signed.</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.480" end="01:25:45.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Boss, shareholders, you can&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.120" end="01:25:47.520" style="s2">barge in here. Formalities?</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.840" end="01:25:49.600" style="s2">The company&#39;s burning down around us,</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.520" end="01:25:51.679" style="s2">and you care about formalities? Our</p>
<p begin="01:25:49.600" end="01:25:54.239" style="s2">stocks in freef fall. We&#39;ve lost half</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.679" end="01:25:57.440" style="s2">our market value already. Do you have a</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.239" end="01:25:59.679" style="s2">plan to fix this? I&#39;ve secured a $1</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.440" end="01:26:02.320" style="s2">billion loan.</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.679" end="01:26:04.239" style="s2">Where is it?</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.320" end="01:26:06.480" style="s2">Just give it time. How [snorts] much</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.239" end="01:26:08.560" style="s2">longer do you expect us to wait? This is</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.480" end="01:26:10.800" style="s2">all your fault, Mr. Boss. What&#39;s that</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.560" end="01:26:12.960" style="s2">supposed to mean? Everyone knows now.</p>
<p begin="01:26:10.800" end="01:26:14.480" style="s2">Your wife is Mrs. Hail of Peak Global,</p>
<p begin="01:26:12.960" end="01:26:16.000" style="s2">and you threw it all away by cheating on</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.480" end="01:26:18.400" style="s2">her. This hold was on you. You need to</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.000" end="01:26:21.360" style="s2">swallow your pride and beg Miss Hail. I</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.400" end="01:26:23.280" style="s2">will not beg Elaine for anything. Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.360" end="01:26:26.679" style="s2">Voss, Dean Crawford from Horizon Bank is</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.280" end="01:26:26.679" style="s2">here with his team.</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.004" end="01:26:31.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.760" end="01:26:31.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The money&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.520" end="01:26:35.880" style="s2">See that? The funding&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.920" end="01:26:40.040" style="s2">We&#39;ll show Mr. Crawford in.</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.760" end="01:26:48.400" style="s2">Mr. Crawford, good to see you. Mr. Voss,</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.320" end="01:26:50.960" style="s2">I was approved for the $1 billion loan.</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.400" end="01:26:52.960" style="s2">Yes, that&#39;s exactly why I&#39;m here. To be</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.960" end="01:26:54.560" style="s2">frank with you, Vostech is in a critical</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.960" end="01:26:57.440" style="s2">position right now. We need that funds</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.560" end="01:26:58.560" style="s2">transferred immediately. Mr. Voss, what</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.440" end="01:27:02.080" style="s2">are you talking about? We already</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.560" end="01:27:03.440" style="s2">deposited the $1 billion. Deposited?</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.080" end="01:27:05.520" style="s2">That can&#39;t be right. We have the</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.440" end="01:27:08.239" style="s2">transaction records to prove it. Show</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.520" end="01:27:09.600" style="s2">Mr. Voss.</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.239" end="01:27:12.600" style="s2">Mr. Voss, here&#39;s the transfer</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.600" end="01:27:12.600" style="s2">confirmation.</p>
<p begin="01:27:15.600" end="01:27:18.880" style="s2">Mr. Crawford, this isn&#39;t my account.</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.280" end="01:27:21.040" style="s2">This is the account listed on the loan</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.880" end="01:27:23.360" style="s2">contract you signed. The account holder</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.040" end="01:27:25.600" style="s2">is Khloe Mercer.</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.360" end="01:27:30.520" style="s2">Chloe Merson. The billion dollars went</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.600" end="01:27:30.520" style="s2">to Chloe. Mr. Voss, she scammed you.</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.320" end="01:27:39.600" style="s2">Chloe scammed me. A whole billion</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.199" end="01:27:41.040" style="s2">dollars. How could this happen? Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.600" end="01:27:43.120" style="s2">Boss, per the contract, the loan term</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.040" end="01:27:44.480" style="s2">was one week. That term is up. Full</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.120" end="01:27:44.880" style="s2">repayment plus interest is due</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.480" end="01:27:46.560" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.880" end="01:27:49.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never saw a scent of that money. Go</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.560" end="01:27:49.800" style="s2">after Chloe.</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.920" end="01:27:54.880" style="s2">This is your signature, is it not?</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.760" end="01:27:57.440" style="s2">Refuse to pay and we will press charges.</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.880" end="01:28:00.920" style="s2">Press charges.</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.440" end="01:28:00.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who called 911?</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.239" end="01:28:06.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did. Jason Voss, CEO of Voss Group,</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.800" end="01:28:07.679" style="s2">took out a $1 billion loan from our bank</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.400" end="01:28:09.120" style="s2">and now he&#39;s denying it. I have every</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.679" end="01:28:11.120" style="s2">reason to believe this is fraud. I</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.120" end="01:28:12.560" style="s2">didn&#39;t do anything wrong. Jason Voss,</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.120" end="01:28:13.920" style="s2">you&#39;re under arrest for suspicion of</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.560" end="01:28:16.239" style="s2">major financial fraud. You&#39;re coming</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.920" end="01:28:22.360" style="s2">with us. No, it&#39;s not me. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.239" end="01:28:22.360" style="s2">defraud. I Mr. Voss, let&#39;s move.</p>
<p begin="01:28:24.800" end="01:28:29.920" style="s2">Told you Jason was no good.</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.840" end="01:28:32.920" style="s2">Without Miss Hail backing him, he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:28:29.920" end="01:28:32.920" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:28:34.320" end="01:28:37.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kiddo, you pulled off a master stroke.</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.920" end="01:28:40.080" style="s2">Squeezed a whole billion out of Jason</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.360" end="01:28:41.920" style="s2">Vot right before we bailed.</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.080" end="01:28:43.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the money is on this card. Once</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.920" end="01:28:45.600" style="s2">we&#39;re out of the country, no one&#39;s ever</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.600" end="01:28:47.360" style="s2">going to find us. Honey, it&#39;s almost</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.600" end="01:28:49.679" style="s2">time to board.</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.360" end="01:28:51.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Attention passengers, your flight is now</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.679" end="01:28:54.760" style="s2">boarding. Please proceed to the gate at</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.600" end="01:28:54.760" style="s2">this time.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.440" end="01:28:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shame I won&#39;t get to say goodbye to you,</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.880" end="01:29:01.040" style="s2">Elaine. So, what if you&#39;re Mrs. Hail of</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.960" end="01:29:03.040" style="s2">Peak Global? You and Jason fought each</p>
<p begin="01:29:01.040" end="01:29:04.880" style="s2">other to the bone and I walked away with</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.040" end="01:29:09.400" style="s2">everything. You&#39;ll always be second best</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.880" end="01:29:09.400" style="s2">to me. Chloe, come on. They&#39;re boarding.</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.639" end="01:29:20.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me. Can you move?</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.199" end="01:29:23.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, don&#39;t you recognize me?</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.880" end="01:29:23.880" style="s2">Who?</p>
<p begin="01:29:25.120" end="01:29:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine. Chloe, I&#39;ve been waiting for</p>
<p begin="01:29:27.840" end="01:29:33.239" style="s2">you. Where exactly were you planning to</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.920" end="01:29:33.239" style="s2">run off to?</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.040" end="01:29:41.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, why are you here? Because you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:29:38.239" end="01:29:43.600" style="s2">here. Simple as that. How did you even</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.360" end="01:29:45.679" style="s2">find me?</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.600" end="01:29:47.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve had people watching you around the</p>
<p begin="01:29:45.679" end="01:29:48.960" style="s2">clock.</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.280" end="01:29:52.120" style="s2">Every move you make gets reported back</p>
<p begin="01:29:48.960" end="01:29:52.120" style="s2">to me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.159" end="01:29:56.199" style="s2">No. Mom, Dad, run.</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.040" end="01:30:08.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop right there.</p>
<p begin="01:30:09.040" end="01:30:14.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it. The police are here.</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.880" end="01:30:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officers, these three are the prime</p>
<p begin="01:30:14.239" end="01:30:17.360" style="s2">suspects in a major fraud case. The</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.000" end="01:30:18.480" style="s2">evidence is right there in her hand.</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.360" end="01:30:19.840" style="s2">Hand it over.</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.480" end="01:30:21.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my money. Give it back.</p>
<p begin="01:30:19.840" end="01:30:22.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s ours. Chloe, the three of you are</p>
<p begin="01:30:21.520" end="01:30:23.920" style="s2">the master kinds behind this fraud</p>
<p begin="01:30:22.800" end="01:30:24.639" style="s2">scheme. We have you dead to rights.</p>
<p begin="01:30:23.920" end="01:30:26.480" style="s2">You&#39;re all under arrest.</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.639" end="01:30:30.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Let me go.</p>
<p begin="01:30:26.480" end="01:30:33.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, save your breath. It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.719" end="01:30:35.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all your fault, Elaine. We still</p>
<p begin="01:30:33.280" end="01:30:38.000" style="s2">have scores to settle. Chloe, did you</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.679" end="01:30:39.679" style="s2">really think I&#39;d let you walk away?</p>
<p begin="01:30:38.000" end="01:30:42.679" style="s2">Neither you nor Jason are getting out of</p>
<p begin="01:30:39.679" end="01:30:42.679" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:30:48.719" end="01:30:53.920" style="s2">Somebody let me out. I didn&#39;t commit</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.320" end="01:30:58.520" style="s2">fraud. I was scammed.</p>
<p begin="01:30:53.920" end="01:30:58.520" style="s2">GO ARREST CHLOE. LET ME OUT OF HERE NOW.</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.159" end="01:31:05.800" style="s2">How did this happen?</p>
<p begin="01:31:06.320" end="01:31:11.760" style="s2">I&#39;m a $3 billion tech founder. I</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.040" end="01:31:15.040" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t be in here. This isn&#39;t right.</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.760" end="01:31:16.080" style="s2">Jason, someone posted bail for you. Who?</p>
<p begin="01:31:15.040" end="01:31:20.120" style="s2">Who bailed me out?</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.080" end="01:31:20.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll see. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.320" end="01:31:27.719" style="s2">Go on in.</p>
<p begin="01:31:32.800" end="01:31:35.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine,</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.679" end="01:31:45.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what? surprised to see me?</p>
<p begin="01:31:41.840" end="01:31:47.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I am. Of all people, Elaine&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="01:31:45.280" end="01:31:53.080" style="s2">one who bailed me out. When everyone</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.520" end="01:31:53.080" style="s2">else left, she&#39;s the one who showed up.</p>
<p begin="01:31:53.600" end="01:31:58.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Khloe&#39;s the scammer, not me.</p>
<p begin="01:31:56.719" end="01:32:00.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:31:58.560" end="01:32:03.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew. Mr. Voss, you were targeted by</p>
<p begin="01:32:00.880" end="01:32:04.400" style="s2">a con ring. Khloe&#39;s father was never a</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.040" end="01:32:06.239" style="s2">professor and her mother was never a</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.400" end="01:32:08.080" style="s2">pianist. They&#39;re both convicted career</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.239" end="01:32:11.360" style="s2">fraudlers.</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.080" end="01:32:13.120" style="s2">Chloe was born into it.</p>
<p begin="01:32:11.360" end="01:32:14.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you saying? She went to a</p>
<p begin="01:32:13.120" end="01:32:16.639" style="s2">finishing school specifically to groom</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.560" end="01:32:20.679" style="s2">and target wealthy men. She set her</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.639" end="01:32:20.679" style="s2">sight straight on you long ago.</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.120" end="01:32:25.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s it. She planned all of this</p>
<p begin="01:32:23.920" end="01:32:27.920" style="s2">from the start. I was played.</p>
<p begin="01:32:25.600" end="01:32:30.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, we have solid evidence to clear</p>
<p begin="01:32:27.920" end="01:32:32.800" style="s2">your name. We can get you out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:32:30.719" end="01:32:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, please get me out of here. I</p>
<p begin="01:32:32.800" end="01:32:37.520" style="s2">knew you&#39;d still care about me.</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.760" end="01:32:39.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can get you out.</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.520" end="01:32:40.719" style="s2">But there&#39;s a condition.</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.520" end="01:32:42.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What condition?</p>
<p begin="01:32:40.719" end="01:32:46.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sign over your 35% stake in Boss</p>
<p begin="01:32:42.800" end="01:32:50.520" style="s2">Tech to me, I&#39;m taking over the company.</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.639" end="01:32:50.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re buying Boss Tech?</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.679" end="01:32:58.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you think? That I came here out</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.239" end="01:32:58.120" style="s2">of the goodness of my heart?</p>
<p begin="01:32:58.320" end="01:33:01.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t come here to save me. You</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.840" end="01:33:03.199" style="s2">came for Vosttech.</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.199" end="01:33:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, Vosttech never would have existed</p>
<p begin="01:33:03.199" end="01:33:06.880" style="s2">without me. I&#39;m just taking back what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.360" end="01:33:08.719" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.880" end="01:33:11.280" style="s2">And if I refuse,</p>
<p begin="01:33:08.719" end="01:33:12.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, I already own 25% of Vostech. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:33:11.280" end="01:33:14.159" style="s2">the second largest shareholder.</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.800" end="01:33:19.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a lie. Where would you get</p>
<p begin="01:33:14.159" end="01:33:19.159" style="s2">shares? We sold our shares to Mrs. Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:33:26.960" end="01:33:30.960" style="s2">All of you, you&#39;re Vos Group</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.280" end="01:33:32.560" style="s2">shareholders. Why would you do this?</p>
<p begin="01:33:30.960" end="01:33:34.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, you let a con woman wrap you</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.560" end="01:33:35.600" style="s2">around her finger. It&#39;s pathetic. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:33:34.159" end="01:33:37.040" style="s2">not a leader. you would run boss tech</p>
<p begin="01:33:35.600" end="01:33:40.400" style="s2">into the ground sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.040" end="01:33:42.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We trust Miss Hail. From now on, we</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.400" end="01:33:44.719" style="s2">stand with Mrs. Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.719" end="01:33:47.199" style="s2">All of you. Derek Watts, you&#39;ve worked</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.719" end="01:33:50.000" style="s2">for me for 5 years. What about you,</p>
<p begin="01:33:47.199" end="01:33:53.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss? This time, you&#39;ve really let</p>
<p begin="01:33:50.000" end="01:33:53.159" style="s2">me down.</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.880" end="01:34:02.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek Watts. Mr. Voss, I&#39;m resigning.</p>
<p begin="01:34:00.719" end="01:34:03.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Derek, you&#39;ll be working directly under</p>
<p begin="01:34:02.159" end="01:34:06.000" style="s2">me from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.120" end="01:34:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. boss. No, Miss Hail, it&#39;s an honor</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.000" end="01:34:10.159" style="s2">to work for you.</p>
<p begin="01:34:08.400" end="01:34:12.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See, Jason, you don&#39;t have the skill,</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.159" end="01:34:14.159" style="s2">even the people skills. No one believes</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.000" end="01:34:15.840" style="s2">in you. Everyone wants me at the helm of</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.159" end="01:34:18.159" style="s2">Vosc.</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.840" end="01:34:19.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Voss, sign the agreement. If you</p>
<p begin="01:34:18.159" end="01:34:21.280" style="s2">don&#39;t, you&#39;ll stay right here in</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.520" end="01:34:24.159" style="s2">custody. Miss Hail will find another way</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.280" end="01:34:26.000" style="s2">to take over Vostech either way.</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.159" end="01:34:27.520" style="s2">Elaine, do I even have a choice?</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.000" end="01:34:30.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.520" end="01:34:33.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, I&#39;ll sign him.</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.880" end="01:34:33.880" style="s2">Congratulations,</p>
<p begin="01:34:33.920" end="01:34:39.120" style="s2">Miss Hail. As of today, boss tech is</p>
<p begin="01:34:36.480" end="01:34:43.159" style="s2">yours. Congratulations, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:34:39.120" end="01:34:43.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:34:45.600" end="01:34:50.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Boss, all paperwork is finalized.</p>
<p begin="01:34:47.440" end="01:34:53.600" style="s2">You&#39;re free to go.</p>
<p begin="01:34:50.159" end="01:34:56.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move it inside,</p>
<p begin="01:34:53.600" end="01:34:56.600" style="s2">Chloe.</p>
<p begin="01:34:57.255" end="01:34:59.275" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.400" end="01:35:07.360" style="s2">Jason.</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.040" end="01:35:09.520" style="s2">Chloe, you lying con artist. Sir, calm</p>
<p begin="01:35:07.360" end="01:35:11.600" style="s2">down. Don&#39;t make THIS WORSE.</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.520" end="01:35:14.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET OFF ME.</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.600" end="01:35:17.199" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing but a fraud. A complete</p>
<p begin="01:35:14.320" end="01:35:20.159" style="s2">and total fraud.</p>
<p begin="01:35:17.199" end="01:35:22.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go. It&#39;s Aubrey.</p>
<p begin="01:35:20.159" end="01:35:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your whole identity was a lie. That</p>
<p begin="01:35:22.480" end="01:35:26.480" style="s2">sweet, caring act was a lie. You</p>
<p begin="01:35:24.800" end="01:35:27.840" style="s2">destroyed my marriage. You destroyed my</p>
<p begin="01:35:26.480" end="01:35:31.400" style="s2">company. YOU RUINED MY LIFE.</p>
<p begin="01:35:27.840" end="01:35:31.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET GO OF ME.</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.920" end="01:35:38.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; REALLY, JASON? You don&#39;t think you had</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.199" end="01:35:39.440" style="s2">anything to do with this?</p>
<p begin="01:35:38.560" end="01:35:41.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My fault.</p>
<p begin="01:35:39.440" end="01:35:42.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You fell for it because you wanted to.</p>
<p begin="01:35:41.440" end="01:35:45.280" style="s2">You got bored of your wife and wanted a</p>
<p begin="01:35:42.880" end="01:35:47.280" style="s2">little excitement on the side. And as</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.280" end="01:35:49.360" style="s2">for your company, you couldn&#39;t even spot</p>
<p begin="01:35:47.280" end="01:35:51.120" style="s2">a fake loan contract. You were stupid</p>
<p begin="01:35:49.360" end="01:35:53.600" style="s2">enough to fall for it. You got what you</p>
<p begin="01:35:51.120" end="01:35:58.120" style="s2">deserved. Oh, and one more thing I lied</p>
<p begin="01:35:53.600" end="01:35:58.120" style="s2">about. I was never pregnant.</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.639" end="01:36:07.199" style="s2">You faked a pregnancy to trick me.</p>
<p begin="01:36:06.159" end="01:36:09.600" style="s2">You monster.</p>
<p begin="01:36:07.199" end="01:36:11.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, stand down.</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.600" end="01:36:13.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a good look at yourself, Jason. A</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.679" end="01:36:16.320" style="s2">man as careless as you. Never could have</p>
<p begin="01:36:13.360" end="01:36:19.199" style="s2">built a $3 billion company on his own.</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.320" end="01:36:21.840" style="s2">Elaine made you who you are. But you</p>
<p begin="01:36:19.199" end="01:36:24.800" style="s2">cheated. You hid your money and lied to</p>
<p begin="01:36:21.840" end="01:36:26.080" style="s2">your own wife. You threw Elaine away.</p>
<p begin="01:36:24.800" end="01:36:28.560" style="s2">The woman who loved you more than</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.080" end="01:36:30.960" style="s2">anyone. This isn&#39;t my fault. You did</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.560" end="01:36:32.320" style="s2">this to yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.960" end="01:36:34.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, the three of you are facing</p>
<p begin="01:36:32.320" end="01:36:36.400" style="s2">multiple felony fraud charges. The</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.480" end="01:36:38.080" style="s2">courts will decide your fate. Jason will</p>
<p begin="01:36:36.400" end="01:36:39.840" style="s2">face the consequences of his choices,</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.080" end="01:36:42.480" style="s2">and you will face yours.</p>
<p begin="01:36:39.840" end="01:36:43.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:36:42.480" end="01:36:46.920" style="s2">It&#39;s all over.</p>
<p begin="01:36:43.679" end="01:36:46.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s move.</p>
<p begin="01:36:47.297" end="01:36:53.920" style="s2">[gasps] Elaine, I</p>
<p begin="01:36:50.239" end="01:36:53.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw, we&#39;re done here.</p>
<p begin="01:37:01.040" end="01:37:04.040" style="s2">Elaine.</p>
<p begin="01:37:11.600" end="01:37:16.960" style="s2">Miss Hail, I think Jason truly regrets</p>
<p begin="01:37:14.159" end="01:37:22.679" style="s2">what he did.</p>
<p begin="01:37:16.960" end="01:37:22.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too little, too late. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:37:22.800" end="01:37:26.280" style="s2">Where to next?</p>
<p begin="01:37:27.040" end="01:37:31.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To officially take over Vostech.</p>
<p begin="01:37:31.520" end="01:37:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you might soften up. I was</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.520" end="01:37:38.480" style="s2">wrong. You&#39;re one of a kind, Elaine.</p>
<p begin="01:37:36.480" end="01:37:42.360" style="s2">Nothing like anyone I&#39;ve ever met.</p>
<p begin="01:37:38.480" end="01:37:42.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail, wait up.</p>
<p begin="01:37:48.560" end="01:37:51.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.000" end="01:37:55.520" style="s2">Elaine,</p>
<p begin="01:37:53.679" end="01:37:59.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; honey, dinner will be ready in just a</p>
<p begin="01:37:55.520" end="01:37:59.639" style="s2">minute. Sit tight, okay?</p>
<p begin="01:38:00.002" end="01:38:02.022" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.000" end="01:38:11.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;d you make tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:38:09.360" end="01:38:14.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All your favorites. You&#39;ve been working</p>
<p begin="01:38:11.280" end="01:38:14.760" style="s2">so hard lately.</p>
<p begin="01:38:18.997" end="01:38:22.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:38:20.880" end="01:38:23.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine,</p>
<p begin="01:38:22.480" end="01:38:27.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what is it?</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.920" end="01:38:27.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. I just wanted to hold you.</p>
<p begin="01:38:27.512" end="01:38:31.880" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:38:27.520" end="01:38:31.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m right here, honey. Always.</p>
<p begin="01:38:45.600" end="01:38:49.159" style="s2">Elaine&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.560" end="01:39:05.560" style="s2">Her</p>
<p begin="01:39:09.920" end="01:39:14.159" style="s2">clothes, her shoes, they&#39;re all gone.</p>
<p begin="01:39:12.880" end="01:39:17.159" style="s2">There&#39;s nothing left of her in this</p>
<p begin="01:39:14.159" end="01:39:17.159" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="01:39:19.440" end="01:39:22.920" style="s2">Our old camera.</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.679" end="01:39:35.560" style="s2">Let&#39;s film more life together.</p>
<p begin="01:39:36.080" end="01:39:40.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow.</p>
<p begin="01:39:38.639" end="01:39:42.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:39:40.639" end="01:39:44.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My shirt tore.</p>
<p begin="01:39:42.159" end="01:39:46.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That thing was so poorly made.</p>
<p begin="01:39:44.159" end="01:39:48.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got it at Goodwill for a few bucks.</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.080" end="01:39:50.719" style="s2">It&#39;s fine. Really?</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.560" end="01:39:52.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, the startup&#39;s still getting off</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.719" end="01:39:54.239" style="s2">the ground. I haven&#39;t made any real</p>
<p begin="01:39:52.719" end="01:39:57.280" style="s2">money yet. And here you are wearing</p>
<p begin="01:39:54.239" end="01:39:59.360" style="s2">cheap clothes.</p>
<p begin="01:39:57.280" end="01:40:00.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, I know you&#39;ll make it big soon.</p>
<p begin="01:39:59.360" end="01:40:02.320" style="s2">And when you do, buy me all the pretty</p>
<p begin="01:40:00.960" end="01:40:03.280" style="s2">clothes I want.</p>
<p begin="01:40:02.320" end="01:40:05.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise.</p>
<p begin="01:40:03.280" end="01:40:06.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And fancy purses, too.</p>
<p begin="01:40:05.119" end="01:40:11.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything you want.</p>
<p begin="01:40:06.239" end="01:40:11.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And we&#39;ll get a big house, our own home.</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.679" end="01:40:14.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We will.</p>
<p begin="01:40:16.480" end="01:40:22.639" style="s2">I love you so much.</p>
<p begin="01:40:19.119" end="01:40:22.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you, too, baby.</p>
<p begin="01:40:33.274" end="01:40:35.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:40:36.480" end="01:40:43.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were so happy once and I threw it all</p>
<p begin="01:40:39.360" end="01:40:46.520" style="s2">away. I lost Elaine. I deserve every bit</p>
<p begin="01:40:43.360" end="01:40:46.520" style="s2">of this.</p>
<p begin="01:40:49.649" end="01:40:52.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:40:50.159" end="01:40:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Sarah.</p>
<p begin="01:40:52.000" end="01:40:57.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, you need to get to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:40:53.840" end="01:40:57.480" style="s2">Madam woke up.</p>
<p begin="01:41:01.600" end="01:41:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, ma&#39;am. Take it slow.</p>
<p begin="01:41:05.679" end="01:41:11.760" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:41:08.400" end="01:41:15.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, there you are. Come closer. I</p>
<p begin="01:41:11.760" end="01:41:15.400" style="s2">need to talk to you.</p>
<p begin="01:41:17.520" end="01:41:25.760" style="s2">I&#39;ll go get you some water, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="01:41:20.080" end="01:41:28.239" style="s2">Jason, that Chloe girl is a fraud.</p>
<p begin="01:41:25.760" end="01:41:31.600" style="s2">She and her parents broke into your safe</p>
<p begin="01:41:28.239" end="01:41:34.320" style="s2">while you were gone. Took everything and</p>
<p begin="01:41:31.600" end="01:41:36.960" style="s2">she pushed me. She&#39;s a manipulative</p>
<p begin="01:41:34.320" end="01:41:41.520" style="s2">liar. I fell for it. Hook, line, and</p>
<p begin="01:41:36.960" end="01:41:43.040" style="s2">sinker. Jason, where&#39;s Elaine?</p>
<p begin="01:41:41.520" end="01:41:45.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, why are you asking about her?</p>
<p begin="01:41:43.040" end="01:41:50.760" style="s2">Jason, you need to win Elaine back.</p>
<p begin="01:41:45.760" end="01:41:50.760" style="s2">She&#39;s a good woman, the best.</p>
<p begin="01:41:53.520" end="01:41:57.280" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, I saw how she treated you all</p>
<p begin="01:41:55.199" end="01:41:59.679" style="s2">these years.</p>
<p begin="01:41:57.280" end="01:42:03.360" style="s2">When your health got bad, she insisted</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.679" end="01:42:06.400" style="s2">you move in with them.</p>
<p begin="01:42:03.360" end="01:42:09.119" style="s2">Every morning at 5:00 a.m., she&#39;d wheel</p>
<p begin="01:42:06.400" end="01:42:11.440" style="s2">you out to the garden for a walk. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:42:09.119" end="01:42:13.600" style="s2">been in a wheelchair all these years and</p>
<p begin="01:42:11.440" end="01:42:16.080" style="s2">she helped you bathe and get dressed</p>
<p begin="01:42:13.600" end="01:42:18.000" style="s2">every single day.</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.080" end="01:42:22.320" style="s2">Once I asked her why she was so kind to</p>
<p begin="01:42:18.000" end="01:42:24.320" style="s2">you. You know what she said?</p>
<p begin="01:42:22.320" end="01:42:28.480" style="s2">You&#39;re ironing Mrs. Voss&#39;s clothes.</p>
<p begin="01:42:24.320" end="01:42:30.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm. Why are you so good to her? Really?</p>
<p begin="01:42:28.480" end="01:42:32.400" style="s2">Sarah, my parents died when I was young.</p>
<p begin="01:42:30.639" end="01:42:34.880" style="s2">I bounced between foster homes for</p>
<p begin="01:42:32.400" end="01:42:37.600" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="01:42:34.880" end="01:42:42.040" style="s2">So family means everything to me. In my</p>
<p begin="01:42:37.600" end="01:42:42.040" style="s2">heart, Jason&#39;s mom is my mom, too.</p>
<p begin="01:42:42.320" end="01:42:46.239" style="s2">Besides, marriage means two people</p>
<p begin="01:42:44.239" end="01:42:50.840" style="s2">working towards the same thing. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:42:46.239" end="01:42:50.840" style="s2">how we build something better together.</p>
<p begin="01:42:51.199" end="01:42:56.320" style="s2">Elaine is such a good girl. I was</p>
<p begin="01:42:53.840" end="01:43:00.520" style="s2">terrible to her. Jason, what are you</p>
<p begin="01:42:56.320" end="01:43:00.520" style="s2">waiting for? Go bring her home.</p>
<p begin="01:43:00.560" end="01:43:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Elaine&#39;s not coming back.</p>
<p begin="01:43:04.400" end="01:43:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="01:43:09.679" end="01:43:13.639" style="s2">Mom, she&#39;s not coming back.</p>
<p begin="01:43:13.840" end="01:43:18.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all my fault.</p>
<p begin="01:43:16.320" end="01:43:20.639" style="s2">I was so awful to her. She must still be</p>
<p begin="01:43:18.800" end="01:43:23.920" style="s2">angry.</p>
<p begin="01:43:20.639" end="01:43:26.960" style="s2">Jason, we&#39;ll go apologize right now.</p>
<p begin="01:43:23.920" end="01:43:28.560" style="s2">We&#39;ll bring her home.</p>
<p begin="01:43:26.960" end="01:43:31.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay,</p>
<p begin="01:43:28.560" end="01:43:31.880" style="s2">let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:43:38.800" end="01:43:43.600" style="s2">Good evening everyone. Welcome to the</p>
<p begin="01:43:40.960" end="01:43:45.440" style="s2">VSTEC press conference. As you all know,</p>
<p begin="01:43:43.600" end="01:43:47.760" style="s2">Vostech has been acquired by Peak</p>
<p begin="01:43:45.440" end="01:43:52.000" style="s2">Global, Miss Hail. Please welcome the</p>
<p begin="01:43:47.760" end="01:43:57.000" style="s2">new CEO of Voss Group, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.000" end="01:43:57.000" style="s2">There she is. Miss Hail is here.</p>
<p begin="01:44:01.840" end="01:44:06.560" style="s2">Thank you all for being here today.</p>
<p begin="01:44:04.320" end="01:44:10.760" style="s2">Moving forward, I will lead Vast Tech to</p>
<p begin="01:44:06.560" end="01:44:10.760" style="s2">greater heights than ever before.</p>
<p begin="01:44:14.800" end="01:44:17.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, there are people here asking for</p>
<p begin="01:44:16.639" end="01:44:18.880" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:44:17.440" end="01:44:20.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is it?</p>
<p begin="01:44:18.880" end="01:44:25.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason and his mother. They&#39;re waiting</p>
<p begin="01:44:20.960" end="01:44:27.360" style="s2">outside. They want to talk to you.</p>
<p begin="01:44:25.280" end="01:44:30.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, it&#39;s them.</p>
<p begin="01:44:27.360" end="01:44:30.920" style="s2">Do you want to see them?</p>
<p begin="01:44:31.920" end="01:44:35.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have nothing to say to them. Tell them</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.000" end="01:44:39.080" style="s2">to leave.</p>
<p begin="01:44:35.840" end="01:44:39.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:44:47.119" end="01:44:50.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Dickens, good to see you.</p>
<p begin="01:44:49.040" end="01:44:51.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail, I&#39;m looking forward to</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.400" end="01:44:54.920" style="s2">working together.</p>
<p begin="01:44:51.920" end="01:44:54.920" style="s2">Likewise,</p>
<p begin="01:44:55.760" end="01:45:01.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, Jason won&#39;t leave.</p>
<p begin="01:44:59.360" end="01:45:03.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call security.</p>
<p begin="01:45:01.760" end="01:45:05.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It won&#39;t help. He says he&#39;ll wait out</p>
<p begin="01:45:03.600" end="01:45:09.159" style="s2">there all day if he has to until you</p>
<p begin="01:45:05.600" end="01:45:09.159" style="s2">agree to see him.</p>
<p begin="01:45:09.840" end="01:45:15.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Deans, excuse me for a moment. I</p>
<p begin="01:45:11.760" end="01:45:15.320" style="s2">need to handle something.</p>
<p begin="01:45:15.760" end="01:45:19.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go see what they want.</p>
<p begin="01:45:27.360" end="01:45:30.719" style="s2">Elaine,</p>
<p begin="01:45:28.960" end="01:45:32.960" style="s2">you came. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:45:30.719" end="01:45:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, thank you for seeing us.</p>
<p begin="01:45:32.960" end="01:45:38.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here, Jason. Say what you came to</p>
<p begin="01:45:35.600" end="01:45:38.600" style="s2">say.</p>
<p begin="01:45:39.360" end="01:45:45.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:45:41.040" end="01:45:45.000" style="s2">I&#39;m here to bring you home.</p>
<p begin="01:45:46.320" end="01:45:50.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, my sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="01:45:50.159" end="01:45:53.119" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="01:45:51.760" end="01:45:55.280" style="s2">Correct me if I&#39;m wrong, but we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:45:53.119" end="01:45:56.639" style="s2">divorced. What home are you talking</p>
<p begin="01:45:55.280" end="01:45:59.440" style="s2">about?</p>
<p begin="01:45:56.639" end="01:46:00.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, this was all my fault. Every bit</p>
<p begin="01:45:59.440" end="01:46:03.280" style="s2">of it.</p>
<p begin="01:46:00.719" end="01:46:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know you were wrong. Then tell me,</p>
<p begin="01:46:03.280" end="01:46:08.320" style="s2">what exactly are you sorry for?</p>
<p begin="01:46:05.360" end="01:46:10.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We loved each other so much. You gave me</p>
<p begin="01:46:08.320" end="01:46:13.679" style="s2">a home. You built my career with me. You</p>
<p begin="01:46:10.719" end="01:46:18.440" style="s2">helped me live my dream. And I threw it</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.679" end="01:46:18.440" style="s2">all away to cheat on you.</p>
<p begin="01:46:19.119" end="01:46:23.520" style="s2">I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:46:21.440" end="01:46:26.323" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:46:23.520" end="01:46:27.600" style="s2">Elaine, I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:46:26.323" end="01:46:32.159" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:46:27.600" end="01:46:34.560" style="s2">Elaine, can you give me one more chance?</p>
<p begin="01:46:32.159" end="01:46:37.119" style="s2">Elaine. [sighs] Elaine, let&#39;s leave the</p>
<p begin="01:46:34.560" end="01:46:40.000" style="s2">past behind us and start over. This</p>
<p begin="01:46:37.119" end="01:46:42.239" style="s2">time, I&#39;ll love you right. I promise.</p>
<p begin="01:46:40.000" end="01:46:44.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine, honey, I was wrong, too. I</p>
<p begin="01:46:42.239" end="01:46:48.280" style="s2">treated you so badly. I promise I&#39;ll do</p>
<p begin="01:46:44.719" end="01:46:48.280" style="s2">better. I&#39;ll change.</p>
<p begin="01:46:56.159" end="01:47:02.600" style="s2">Elaine, [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:46:58.800" end="01:47:02.600" style="s2">you&#39;ll come home with me.</p>
<p begin="01:47:07.760" end="01:47:12.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This act of yours, Jason, it doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:47:10.000" end="01:47:13.920" style="s2">feel real. For 5 years, all I saw was</p>
<p begin="01:47:12.400" end="01:47:16.080" style="s2">your arrogance, your half-hearted</p>
<p begin="01:47:13.920" end="01:47:19.440" style="s2">excuses, your coldness. Who are you</p>
<p begin="01:47:16.080" end="01:47:20.719" style="s2">putting the show off for?</p>
<p begin="01:47:19.440" end="01:47:22.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine.</p>
<p begin="01:47:20.719" end="01:47:25.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I love someone, I love him with</p>
<p begin="01:47:22.880" end="01:47:27.760" style="s2">everything I have.</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.119" end="01:47:29.520" style="s2">I don&#39;t regret those 5 years. It didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:47:27.760" end="01:47:31.840" style="s2">work out.</p>
<p begin="01:47:29.520" end="01:47:34.560" style="s2">But I own my choices.</p>
<p begin="01:47:31.840" end="01:47:36.880" style="s2">But Jason, I only ever give one chance.</p>
<p begin="01:47:34.560" end="01:47:40.159" style="s2">You used yours up.</p>
<p begin="01:47:36.880" end="01:47:42.080" style="s2">This ring feels heavy and wrong. Jason,</p>
<p begin="01:47:40.159" end="01:47:45.080" style="s2">take it and stay out of my life for</p>
<p begin="01:47:42.080" end="01:47:45.080" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="01:47:48.199" end="01:47:52.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:47:49.280" end="01:47:52.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elaine.</p>
<p begin="01:47:55.280" end="01:48:02.239" style="s2">Elaine. Mom is sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:47:58.960" end="01:48:06.520" style="s2">Mrs. Voss, my mom died a long time ago,</p>
<p begin="01:48:02.239" end="01:48:06.520" style="s2">and I never want to see you again.</p>
<p begin="01:48:08.960" end="01:48:11.960" style="s2">Elaine,</p>
<p begin="01:48:14.880" end="01:48:18.760" style="s2">she&#39;s not coming home.</p>
<p begin="01:48:21.679" end="01:48:25.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:48:26.400" end="01:48:32.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was waiting for you, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:48:29.040" end="01:48:32.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you come inside?</p>
<p begin="01:48:32.800" end="01:48:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw Jason was here.</p>
<p begin="01:48:35.520" end="01:48:38.880" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know if you&#39;d give him another</p>
<p begin="01:48:36.880" end="01:48:41.679" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="01:48:38.880" end="01:48:44.800" style="s2">I won&#39;t. The day I found out the truth,</p>
<p begin="01:48:41.679" end="01:48:47.199" style="s2">that was the end of us.</p>
<p begin="01:48:44.800" end="01:48:48.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The verdict came in. Khloe got 12 years.</p>
<p begin="01:48:47.199" end="01:48:51.480" style="s2">Her parents got eight and six,</p>
<p begin="01:48:48.480" end="01:48:51.480" style="s2">respectively.</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.639" end="01:48:57.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For people like Khloe, prison is where</p>
<p begin="01:48:54.639" end="01:49:00.905" style="s2">they belong.</p>
<p begin="01:48:57.679" end="01:49:01.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all over now, Miss Hail.</p>
<p begin="01:49:00.905" end="01:49:05.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:49:01.360" end="01:49:05.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, it&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:49:07.360" end="01:49:13.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Hail,</p>
<p begin="01:49:09.119" end="01:49:13.239" style="s2">remember that dinner you owe me?</p>
<p begin="01:49:13.760" end="01:49:17.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you have dinner with me tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:49:18.239" end="01:49:23.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I almost forgot about that.</p>
<p begin="01:49:20.239" end="01:49:23.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:49:24.400" end="01:49:28.159" style="s2">Miss Hail, there&#39;s something I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:49:25.600" end="01:49:31.119" style="s2">wanting to tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:49:28.159" end="01:49:31.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:49:37.119" end="01:49:42.639" style="s2">This is the first time I&#39;ve said your</p>
<p begin="01:49:38.560" end="01:49:46.119" style="s2">name out loud. Elaine Hail,</p>
<p begin="01:49:42.639" end="01:49:46.119" style="s2">I like you.</p>
<p begin="01:49:50.159" end="01:49:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You like me?</p>
<p begin="01:49:53.119" end="01:49:59.040" style="s2">From the moment I met you, I was drawn</p>
<p begin="01:49:56.000" end="01:50:02.040" style="s2">to how sharp, brave, and independent you</p>
<p begin="01:49:59.040" end="01:50:02.040" style="s2">are.</p>
<p begin="01:50:03.920" end="01:50:11.320" style="s2">Elaine, I like you.</p>
<p begin="01:50:07.520" end="01:50:11.320" style="s2">Will you give me a chance?</p>
<p begin="01:50:12.639" end="01:50:20.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw, thank you. For what it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:50:15.360" end="01:50:20.760" style="s2">worth, I&#39;m flattered, but I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:50:22.480" end="01:50:26.080" style="s2">Why did I do something wrong? I can fix</p>
<p begin="01:50:25.360" end="01:50:28.400" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:50:26.080" end="01:50:31.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t done anything wrong. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:50:28.400" end="01:50:34.679" style="s2">wonderful.</p>
<p begin="01:50:31.360" end="01:50:34.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why,</p>
<p begin="01:50:36.080" end="01:50:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw? After everything that happened</p>
<p begin="01:50:37.760" end="01:50:43.360" style="s2">with my marriage, I realized my life</p>
<p begin="01:50:40.480" end="01:50:47.639" style="s2">doesn&#39;t have to revolve around romance.</p>
<p begin="01:50:43.360" end="01:50:47.639" style="s2">There are bigger things I want to build.</p>
<p begin="01:50:54.880" end="01:50:58.639" style="s2">Elaine, the fourth gen chip team hit a</p>
<p begin="01:50:56.960" end="01:51:01.679" style="s2">major technical wall. They need you back</p>
<p begin="01:50:58.639" end="01:51:05.360" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="01:51:01.679" end="01:51:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shaw, I&#39;m moving forward. My story</p>
<p begin="01:51:05.360" end="01:51:11.560" style="s2">with Jason may be over, but my story is</p>
<p begin="01:51:08.080" end="01:51:11.560" style="s2">just getting started.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
